    "b_0045": "<strong>#🛡️︱sythe-vouches</strong> (Discord): 11 vouches (30 ago–9 nov 2026) al hilo de Sythe; sin precios (volúmenes de GP y totales: \"Over $2000 spent in services\", \"over $1300 worth of services for me on HCIM\").",
    "b_0046": "<strong>#🧮︱gp-calculator</strong> (6–9 nov 2026): Buy Rate $0.280 (por 1M GP). Ejemplos: 100M GP → $28.000; 350M GP → $98.000; 400M GP → $112.000. Payment Methods: Crypto. Mismo disclaimer de tarifas estimadas.",
