    "b_0049": "<strong>1 Defence Pure: $700</strong>, total 1,559, 88/184 quests, 156/343 QP, incluye Desert Treasure II, Infernal Cape gratis y servicio de Quiver. Stats: Attack 60, HP 99, Mining 70, Strength 99, Agility 71, Smithing 65, Defence 1, Herblore 77, Fishing 59, Ranged 99, Thieving 70, Cooking 62, Prayer 63, Construction 71, Firemaking 75, Magic 99, Crafting 54, Woodcutting 61, Runecraft 63, Slayer 58, Farming 37, Hunter 83, Sailing 58.",
