    "b_0052": "<strong>35+ Normal Harpoon $0.064, 61+ Dragon $0.0592, 71+ Crystal $0.056, 75+ Infernal $0.0528; Only Regular Harpoon? +15%.</strong> (pestaña Minigames — difiere de la pestaña Fishing, ver discrepancias).",
    "b_0053": "<strong>45 Defence, First Capes:</strong> Max Gear Login $80 / Parsec $100. On Task: Maxed Gear Login $70 / Parsec $90. Extras: ACB $120. +$5 per blowpipe dart downgrade. +$5 low magic. +5-20 low range (así publicado, sin $ en el segundo tramo).",
