    "b_0087": "<strong>Bones Collecting</strong> (título del contenido: «Efficient Dragon Farming for Ironman»): Green Dragons 175k each; Blue Dragons (70+ Agility) 137.5k each; Blue Dragons (Less than 70 Agility) 155k each.",
