    "b_0106": "<strong>Chambers of Xeric (CoX) — 34 tareas.</strong>\nElite: Blizzard Dodger $2.00. CoX Veteran $80.00. Cryo No More $5.00. Dancing with Statues $2.00. Kill It with Fire $2.00. Mutta-diet $2.00. Perfectly Balanced $2.00. Redemption Enthusiast $2.00. Shayzien Specialist $2.00. Together We'll Fall $5.00. Undying Raid Team $6.00. Dust Seeker (CM) $8.00.\nMaster: A Not So Special Lizard $8.00. Anvil No More $3.00. Blind Spot $4.00. CoX Master $225.00. No Time for Death $5.00. Perfect Olm (Solo) $17.00. Perfect Olm (Trio) $24.00. Playing with Lasers $2.00. Putting It Olm on the Line $8.00. Stop Drop and Roll $5.00. Undying Raider $7.00. CoX CM Master $53.00. Immortal Raider $10.00. Immortal Raid Team $12.00.\nGrandmaster: CoX (5-Scale) Speed-Runner $26.50. CoX Grandmaster $500.00. CoX (Solo) Speed-Runner $14.00. CoX (Trio) Speed-Runner $21.50. CoX CM (5-Scale) Speed-Runner $29.00. CoX CM Grandmaster $125.00. CoX CM (Solo) Speed-Runner $15.00. CoX CM (Trio) Speed-Runner $24.00.",
    "b_0107": "<strong>Chambers of Xeric (CoX)</strong> — /services/chambers-of-xeric, from $2.30/run.\n- Normal: Solo $2.80. Trio $2.30. Full Size (5-scale) Solo $4.30. Trio $3.20.\n- Challenge Mode (CM): Solo $5.10. Trio $3.74.\n- Recargos: Fang en lugar de Lance/Scythe +15%. No Rigour +10%. No Augury +5%. Parsec +50%. 15+ runs: 10% de descuento.",
    "b_0108": "<strong>Chambers of Xeric - Normal Mode:</strong> [CNMSL] - A Not So Special Lizard = $5; [CNSSR] - CoX Solo Speed-Runner = $20; [CNTSR] - CoX Trio Speed-Runner = $25; [CNSSR] - CoX 5 Man Speed-Runner = $40 (código [CNSSR] repetido, tal como se publicó); [CNPIO] - Putting It Olm on the Line = $15; [CNPOS] - Perfect Olm Solo = $15; [CNPOT] - Perfect Olm Trio = $25.",
    "b_0109": "<strong>Chambers of Xeric:</strong> Solo Normal (Reg) — With DHL or Bowfa 12m/kc ($3,60); Without DHL or Bowfa (With Whip/Blade) 15m/kc. Challenge Mode — Max Stats &amp; Gear 23m/kc; Low Gear or Stats Charge Up Price: Variable. Mass (VPN/Login - Boosting) — Regular CoX 6m/kc, CM CoX 12m/kc. Boosting — CoX Boosting Trio (You + 2) 17m for 1KC, CM (2 booster) Trio 24m/kc. Additional Charges: No Rigour/Augury +500k, Sub 90 combat stats +500k, Sub 80 combat stats +1.5m, No BGS/D [truncado, sin cifra ni detalle].",
    "b_0110": "<strong>Champion Scrolls por KC</strong> (6k–35k por kill según monstruo) y <strong>Clue Scroll Completions por tier</strong> (800k–12m por clue).",
