    "b_0126": "<strong>Compra/venta de GP</strong> con tarifas publicadas (Sell $0.225 / Buy $0.28 por 1M) y calculadora de GP.",
    "b_0127": "<strong>Construction Supplies</strong> (por plank): Planks W/ Logs Banked $0.00065, W/O $0.00086; Oak Planks W/ $0.00065, W/O $0.00128; Teak Planks W/ $0.00065, W/O $0.00233; Mahogany Planks W/ $0.00065, W/O $0.00275.",
