    "b_0450": "<strong>The Fractured Archive (Raids 4 / TFA)</strong> — /services/the-fractured-archive, from $9.75/run. Precio por clear según entrega y tamaño de equipo:\n- Login: Duo $14.50. Trio $12.00. 4+ $9.75.\n- Carry: Duo $17.25. Trio $14.25. 4+ $11.25.\n- Parsec: Duo $21.75. Trio $18.00. 4+ $14.63 (Parsec = Login +50%).\n- Descuentos por volumen: 5+ runs 10% off. 10+ 15% off. 20+ 30% off. Recargos por equipo que falta: No Scythe/Inquisitor's +10%. No Tonalztics of Ralos +15%. No Blowpipe +5%. No Full Inquisitor's +20%. No Twisted Bow +20%. TFA Purple garantizada: from $300. Hydra leather / Rondache Protection en Guaranteed Drops: from $450.",
    "b_0451": "<strong>The Nightmare / Phosani's Nightmare — 24 tareas.</strong>\nHard: Nightmare Adept $2.00.\nElite: Phosani's Nightmare Veteran $3.00. Explosion! $8.00. Phosani's Nightmare (5-Scale) Speed-Trialist $13.00. Phosani's Nightmare (Solo) Speed-Trialist $9.00. Nightmare Veteran $25.00. Sleep Tight $5.00.\nMaster: Crush Hour $10.00. Dreamland Express $22.00. I Would Simply React $11.00. Phosani's Nightmare Master $10.00. Phosani's Nightmare Speedchaser $9.00. Phosani's Nightmare (5-Scale) Speed-Chaser $9.00. Nightmare Master $75.00. Phosani's Nightmare (Solo) Speed-Chaser $12.00. Perfect Nightmare $18.00.\nGrandmaster: Can't Wake Up $40.00. Perfect Phosani's Nightmare $30.00. Phosani's Nightmare Grandmaster $40.00. Phosani's Nightmare Speedrunner $23.00. A Long Trip $18.00. Phosani's Nightmare (5-Scale) Speed-Runner $18.00. Phosani's Nightmare (Solo) Speed-Runner $20.00. Terrible Parent $12.00.",
