    "b_0453": "<strong>Theatre of Blood (ToB) — 47 tareas.</strong>\nHard: SM Adept $5.00.\nElite: ToB Veteran $125.00. Anticoagulants $2.00. Appropriate Tools $2.00. Attack, Step, Wait $2.00. Chally Time $2.00. Don't Look at Me $2.00. Just To Be Safe $2.00. No-Pillar $2.00. Nylocas On Rocks $2.00. Pass It On $2.00. They Won't Expect This $2.00.\nMaster: A Timely Snack $10.00. Back in My Day $14.00. Can't Drain This $10.00. Can You Dance $10.00. Perfect Bloat $10.00. Perfect Maiden $10.00. Perfect Nylocas $14.00. Perfect Sotetseg $15.00. Perfect Verzik $22.00. Perfect Xarpus $18.00. Pop It $22.00. ToB Master $325.00. Two-Down $4.00. SM Speed-Chaser $10.00. (Hard Mode) Completed It $10.00.\nGrandmaster: Morytania Only $42.00. Perfect Theatre $90.00. ToB (4-Scale) Speed-Runner $40.00. ToB (5-Scale) Speed-Runner $44.00. ToB (Duo) Speed-Runner $25.00. ToB Grandmaster $600.00. ToB (Trio) Speed-Runner $28.00. ToB: Harder Mode I $30.00. Harder Mode II $36.00. Harder Mode III $36.00. Nylo Sniper $30.00. Pack Like a Yak $32.00. Personal Space $13.00. Royal Affairs $22.00. Stop Right There $10.00. Team Work $33.00. ToB: Harder Mode (4-Scale) Speed-Runner $38.00. Harder Mode (5-Scale) Speed-Runner $44.00. Harder Mode (Trio) Speed-Runner $28.00. ToB: Harder Mode Grandmaster $350.00.",
    "b_0454": "<strong>Theatre of Blood (ToB)</strong> — /services/theatre-of-blood, from $4.25/run.\n- Login/Parsec Normal: 3-man $5.15. 4-man $4.25.\n- Login/Parsec Hard Mode: $5.95/run (sin selector de equipo en la calculadora).\n- Carry Normal: 4-man $5.55. 5-man $6.76.\n- Carry Hard Mode: 4-man $9.55. 5-man $12.35.\n- Parsec +50%. Descuentos: 15+ runs 10% off. 30+ runs 15% off. Pot boosting: $4.00 por poción.",
    "b_0455": "<strong>Theatre of Blood:</strong> TOB Logins — Standard ToB with Scythe 14m/kc ($4,20); Standard ToB Whip &amp; Blade 16m/kc. Hard Mode Logins — Standard HMT with Scythe 25m/kc. Standard TOB Carries — 2 Boosters + Client (trio) 13m/kc; 3 Boosters + Client (4man) 16m/kc. Mismos Additional Charges que CoX (No Rigour/Augury +500k, Sub 90 +500k, Sub 80 +1.5m, No BGS/D truncado).",
