    "b_0462": "<strong>ToA KC</strong> (asume Solo Logins; 50+ KC = 5% de descuento, debe completarse en su totalidad; posibles recargos por equipo, stats y oraciones): Entry (50 invo) 6m/kc ($1.80); Normal 150 7m/kc ($2.10); Normal 200 8m/kc ($2.40); Normal 250 10m/kc ($3.00); Expert 300 13m/kc ($3.90); Expert 400 22m/kc ($6.60).\n<strong>ToA Cosmetics</strong> (max stats y equipo): Assembler (350) 40m ($12.00); Ward (425) 80m ($24.00); Each Pet Morph (450) 125m ($37.50); Kephri (450) 175m ($52.50); Fang (500) 225m ($67.50).\n<strong>ToA Elite CAs</strong> (max gear; recargo si no es max gear): Perfect Crondis 5m ($1.50); Perfect Het 5m — «82 mining + dragon pickaxe» ($1.50); Perfect Apmeken 15m ($4.50); No skipping allowed 15m ($4.50); Dropped the ball 15m ($4.50); Down Do Specs 20m ($6.00); Hardcore Raiders 35m ($10.50); Hardcore Tombs 15m ($4.50); Helpful Spirit Who 30m ($9.00); I'm in a rush 15m ($4.50).\n<strong>ToA Master CAs:</strong> You are not Prepared 50m ($15.00); Tombs speed runner 50m ($15.00); Better get movin' 45m ($13.50); Chompington 15m ($4.50); Perfect Akkha 125m ($37.50); Perfect Ba-Ba 60m ($18.00); Perfect Zebak 30m ($9.00); Perfect Scabaras 5m ($1.50); Perfect Kephri 60m ($18.00); Perfect Warden 100m ($30.00); Something of an expert myself 40m ($12.00); Ba-Bananza 75m ($22.50); Rockin' around the croc 75m ($22.50); Doesn't bug me 100m ($30.00); All out of medics 90m ($27.00); Warden't you believe it 15m ($4.50); Resourceful Raider 75m ($22.50); But... Damage 100m ($30.00); Fancy Feet 90m ($27.00).\n<strong>ToA GM CAs:</strong> Tombs Speed Runner II 100m ($30.00); Tombs Speed Runner III 400m ($120.00); Amascut's Remnant 225m ($67.50); Maybe I'm the boss. 100m ($30.00); Akkhan't Do it. 120m ($36.00); All Praise Zebak 150m ($45.00); Perfection of Het 185m ($55.50); Perfection of Apmeken 110m ($33.00); Perfection of Crondis 75m ($22.50); Perfection of Scabaras 110m ($33.00); Insanity 200m ($60.00).",
