    "b_0464": "<strong>ToA Solo (!b toas 100; Ray 23/08/26 y Ali 19/11/26; descuento None):</strong> 150+ Invo $2.31/kill ($231.00/$254.10 por 100); 200+ $2.52 ($252.00/$277.20); 250+ $2.94 ($294.00/$323.40); 300+ $3.57 ($357.00/$392.70); 350+ $4.20 ($420.00/$462.00); 410+ $5.46 ($546.00/$600.60); 450+ $6.30 ($630.00/$693.00). No Sun Keris +15%.",
