    "b_0468": "<strong>ToB KC</strong> (max stats/gear; recargo por cada objeto que falte, incluidos tent whip (o mejor), dwh, bp, trident, full void; el cliente conserva todo el loot): Standard ToB 15m/kc ($4.50); Hard Mode ToB 20m/kc ($6.00); 50+ kc 5% de descuento (debe completarse en su totalidad). <strong>Supply Chest Runs</strong> (acceso al cofre de Bloat; se puede comprar 1 stamina y varias brews/restores por run): Logins 10m/chest ($3.00).\n<strong>ToB CAs:</strong> Perfect Theatre 600M ($180.00); Morytania Only 150M ($45.00); Theatre (Duo) SpeedRunner (sub 26:00) 150M ($45.00); Theatre (Trio) SpeedRunner (sub 17:30) 185M ($55.50); Theatre (4Man) SpeedRunner (sub 15:00) 225M ($67.50); Theatre (5Man) SpeedRunner (sub 14:15) 255M ($76.50); Perfect Maiden 30M ($9.00); Perfect Bloat 30M ($9.00); Perfect Nylo 30M ($9.00); Perfect Sote 30M ($9.00); Perfect Xarpus 40m ($12.00); Perfect Verzik 90M ($27.00); Can't Drain This 35M ($10.50); Two-Down 15M ($4.50); A Timely Snack 40M ($12.00); Can You Dance? 30M ($9.00); Pop It 40M ($12.00); Back in My Day... 65M ($19.50).\n<strong>HMT CAs:</strong> Stop Right There! 40M ($12.00); Personal Space 60M ($18.00); Royal Affairs 100M ($30.00); Harder Mode I 70M ($21.00); Harder Mode II 175M ($52.50); Hard Mode III 145m ($43.50); Nylo Sniper 100M ($30.00); Team Work Makes The Dream Work 100M ($30.00); Pack Like a Yak 110M ($33.00); HM (Trio) Speed-Runner (sub 23:00) 185M ($55.50); HM (4-Scale) Speed-Runner (sub 21:00) 225M ($67.50); HM (5-Scale) Speed-Runner (sub 19:00) 255M ($76.50).",
    "b_0469": "<strong>ToB Staminas</strong> (se recogerá 1 Stamina potion por run, usando los puntos restantes para comprar Brews y Restores): Login – 1 Run $3.80; Login – 10 Runs $28.50; Boosting – 1 Run $2.00; Boosting – 10 Runs $15.00.",
