    "b_0635": "Comandos <code>!s attack 40-80</code> y <code>!s defence 40-80</code>, corridos en el canal Calculator el 19/11/26. El bot no dio ninguna opción ni precio F2P diferenciado, solo precios via Crypto / via Non-Crypto, y los métodos que lista son de members (Sand Crabs, Gemstone Crabs, NMZ). 1,95M XP cada skill. Primer valor via Crypto, segundo via Non-Crypto.",
    "b_0636": "Combat Achievement Bundle: $50.00 fijo por las 8 tareas (Maggot Squasher Hard. Trying to Fit In Elite. Digging In Master. Cordoned Off Master. Maggot King Speed Chaser Master. Camping the King Master. King-Sized Clobbering Master. Perfect Maggot King). Max gear (ZCB + Scythe). Parsec +50%.",
    "b_0637": "Combat Achievements (web tarea por tarea vs menús de Discord §A5–A7): Perfect Akkha web $18.00 vs Discord $11.00; Perfect Wardens web $26.00 vs Discord $20.00 (Perfect Warden); Perfect Zebak web $5.00 vs Discord $4.00 (en «Perfect Baba / Kephri / Zebak $4 each»); Amascut's Remnant web $50.00 vs Discord $45.00; Rockin' around the croc web $8.00 vs Discord $10.00; The Worst Ranged Weapon web $15.00 vs Discord $7.50 («Worst Ranged Weapon»); Commander Showdown web $1.00 vs Discord $4.00 («Commander»); I was here first! web $3.00 vs Discord $1.00. Colosseum: en Discord las CAs son recargos sobre un Quiver (One-off / I Brought Mine Too / Showboating / Speed-Runner = Quiver +$5; Reinforcements +$15; Perfect Footwork / Slow Dancing +$10); en web son precios individuales standalone (One-off $50.00, I Brought Mine Too $50.00, Showboating $50.00, Colosseum Speed-Runner $50.00, Reinforcements $60.00, Perfect Footwork $55.00, Slow Dancing $55.00). Coinciden: Insanity $40, Morytania Only $42, Perfect Theatre $90, Harder Mode I/II/III $30/$36/$36, Perfect Olm Solo $17 / Trio $24, Feather Hunter $45, Peach Conjurer $40, Ash Collector $20, Perfect Nex $10, Nex Duo $10, Inferno Speed-Runner $55, Budget Setup $70, The Floor Is Lava $70, Wasn't Even Close $70, Nibbler Chaser $70, Playing with Jads $55, Gauntlet Speed-Runner $16, CG Speed-Runner $17, Egniol Diet $5 / II $5.50, Defence Doesn't Matter $3.50 / II $8.00.",
    "b_0638": "Comparación 1-99 (método más barato de cada servidor): Elite $293,27 (Myth Cape Racks) frente a Lorax $78,46, NDS $143,81, TONS $188,78 y Bald $100,94 — Elite es con diferencia el más caro en Construction. Para 87→99: Elite $203,90 frente a Lorax $54,37, NDS $67,97, Bald ~$70,18 y TONS ~$131,25.",
    "b_0639": "Competidores con Kings (USD)",
