    "b_0876": "Reward unlocks: Log Basket $12.00 cada uno. Jeweller's Chisel $20.00. Imbue Scroll $5.00. Plank Sack $20.00 (Teak planks +15%. Under 70 Construction +25%). Fletching Knife $25.00. Amy's Saw $30.00 (Teak planks +15%. Under 70 Construction +25%). Expert Mining Gloves $40.00.",
    "b_0877": "Ritmo: unas 250–350 por hora normal con box traps (80+, 5 trampas), unas 500–600 por hora con 3-tick. Para 30,000: unas <strong>100 horas</strong> normal, unas <strong>60 horas</strong> con 3-tick.",
