    "b_0015": "(1-55) Starter Methods; (55-85) Ardy Knights — No Ardougne Diary +15%; (85-99) Ardy Knights — No Ardougne Diary +15%; (65-99) Blackjack Method; (70-85) Master Farmer — No Seed Box +15%; (85-95) Master Farmer — No Seed Box +15%; (95-99) Master Farmer — No Seed Box +15%; (51-61), (61-71), (71-81), (81-91), (91-99) Pyramid Plunder. No fixed price.",
    "b_0016": "(1-70) Sand Crabs (Main / Zerker), (70-99) Sand Crabs (Main / Zerker), (1-70) Gemstone Crabs (Main / Zerker), (70-99) Gemstone Crabs (Main / Zerker), (1-70) Sand Crabs (Pure), (70-99) Sand Crabs (Pure), (1-70) Gemstone Crabs (Pure), (70-99) Gemstone Crabs (Pure), (70-90) Nightmare Zone (Any Account), (90-99) Nightmare Zone (Any Account). No fixed price.",
