    "b_0018": "(1-70) Sand Crabs, (70-99) Sand Crabs, (1-70) Gemstone Crabs, (70-99) Gemstone Crabs; (70-99) Chinning MM1 Tunnel w/ Salve — No Salve +25%; (70-99) Chinning MM2 Tunnel; (70-90) Nightmare Zone w/ Ventor or Blowpipe — Ironman w/ MSB +25%; (90-99) Nightmare Zone w/ Ventor or Blowpipe — Ironman w/ MSB +25%; (1-99) Cannon Only (No Hitpoints Method). No fixed price in dollars.",
    "b_0019": "(1-99) Dragon Bones via Gilded Altar — Chaos Altar +50%; (70-99) Superior Bones via Gilded Altar — Chaos Altar +65%. No fixed price in dollars.",
    "b_0020": "(1-99) Splashing, (1-55) Starter Methods, (55-99) High Alchemy, (1-60) Sand Crabs, (60-99) Sand Crabs, (1-60) Gemstone Crabs, (60-99) Gemstone Crabs, (64-99) Burst / Barrage MM1 Tunnel, (64-99) Burst / Barrage MM2 Tunnel, (60-90) Nightmare Zone, (90-99) Nightmare Zone, (80-99) String Jewellery. No fixed price.",
    "b_0021": "(All prices assume at least 1 wilderness weapon — flail/staff/craws; assume max unless stated otherwise; surcharges for missing gear/stats.) <strong>Artio</strong> (the CAs are labelled «Callisto»): 1m — Craws/Webweaver ($0.30); 1.2m — Bowfa+crystal ($0.36). CAs: Callisto Adept (10kc) — KC Task; Callisto Veteran (20kc) — KC Task. <strong>Chaos Elemental:</strong> 600k — Wildy Weapons ($0.18); 750k+ — No wildy weapon ($0.23+). CAs: Chaos Elemental Adept (10kc) — KC Task; Hoarder 5m ($1.50); The Flincher 15m ($4.50); Chaos Elemental Veteran (20kc) — KC Task. <strong>Calvar'ion (Vet'ion):</strong> 1.00m — Vigorra/Ursine chainmace ($0.30); 1.25m — Bludgeon ($0.38); 1.35m — Cudgel/Zombie axe ($0.41). CAs: Vet'ion Adept (10kc) — KC Task; Vet'eran (20kc) [sic] — KC Task. <strong>Scorpia:</strong> 500k — Accursed Sceptre w/ freezes ($0.15); 600k — Trident w/ freezes ($0.18); 750k — ibans + snares (no trident) ($0.23). CAs: Scorpia Adept (10kc) — KC Task; I Can't Reach That 5m ($1.50); Guardians No More 5m ($1.50); Scorpia Veteran (20kc) — KC Task. <strong>Spindel (Venenatis):</strong> 1.00m — Vigorra/Ursine Chainmace ($0.30); 1.25m — Bludgeon ($0.38); 1.35m — Cudgel/Zombie axe ($0.41). CAs: Venenatis Adept (10kc) — KC Task; Venenatis Veteran (20kc) — KC Task. <strong>Chaos Fanatic &amp; Crazy Archaeologist:</strong> 400k — 1kc ($0.12). Chaos Fanatic CAs: Chaos Fanatic Adept (25kc) — KC Task; Praying to the Gods 15m ($4.50). Crazy Archaeologist CAs: Crazy Archaeologist Adept (25kc) — KC Task.",
    "b_0022": "1. Skills (23 options; the menu does NOT include Hitpoints — there is no Hitpoints tab)",
    "b_0023": "11. Pet Boosting (PET BOOSTING TICKET - ALL POSSIBLE PETS tab, calculator !pb corp)",
    "b_0024": "34 categories; «from» prices: Impling hunting from $0.04 (4). Farming runs from $0.41 (6). Birdhouse runs from $0.35 (2). Mining from $1.00 (5). Making cannonballs from $0.50 (2). Herbiboar from $0.08 (2). Karambwans / POH + Fairy ring from $2.20 (4). Sharks / Minnows from $4.40 (3). Anglerfish from $9.00 (2). Ecu keys from $0.60 (2). Collecting dragon bones from $0.05 (3). Red chinchompas from $7.00 (3). Plank making from $1.00 (4). Making glass from $2.00 (2). Buying ores from $1.00 (3). Agility pyramid from $10.00 (2). Morytania fungus from $3.00 (2). White berries from $10.00 (1). Blue dragon scales from $5.00 (2). Pharaoh's sceptre from $18.00 (5). Wines of Zamorak from $10.00 (2). Red spiders' eggs from $3.00 (2). Snape grass from $4.00 (1). Sunfire splinters from $1.00 (1). Black Chinchompas from $20.00 (1). Bloodwood Tree from $0.10 (1). Collecting Frost Dragon Bones from $0.07 (1). Cooking Fish from $2.00 (1). Mixes from $20.00 (2). Pickpocketing NPC's from $1.70 (9). Potion Making from $2.00 (2). Slayer from $30.00 (1). Smithing Bars from $1.00 (4). Teleport Tabs from $3.00 (2). Volcanic Ashe Mining from $2.00 (3).",
