    "b_0056": "<strong>UPDATE 9-11-2026 (third visit): the «Misc» tasks were broken down in §F1b (308 tasks with name, tier and price: Easy 38, Medium 58, Hard 65, Elite 79, Master 48, Grandmaster 20).</strong> Still unaccounted for: a 10-task difference between the page total (622) and the sum of both visits (304 + 308 = 612), attributable to the per-category counts of the previous visit (see §F1b). Still without an individual price: Maggot Squasher (Hard) from Maggot King (7 of its 8 tasks already have a price; the bundle of all 8 costs $50.00). Still not broken down in detail: the remaining collapsed options in Minigames and Ironman Gathering (only their «from» price); and in Minigames, Clues From Scratch has no published price (0 options). In Giants Foundry, MTA and Clues the number of options shown on the page does not exactly match the price lines listed, as noted in each case. The gear breakdown of ~35 bosses (only «from» + no. of options) still has not been extracted in detail.",
