    "b_0061": "<strong>Account Builds:</strong> ToA Account Build Discord $140 vs web $240. DS2 Discord $110 vs web $150. DT2 $350 web only (no price on Discord). Quest Cape Main Discord $450 vs web $449. Ironman Quest Cape Discord $1,100 vs web $1,099. SOTE $620, Firemaking $150, Thieving $250, Agility $750, B Gloves $220, Mithril Gloves $40, Barrows Gloves $72, Thralls $70 and Spec XFer $70 match in both.",
    "b_0062": "<strong>General agreement:</strong> by joining, creating a ticket or buying, these terms are accepted. 2. <strong>Respect and conduct:</strong> toxicity, harassment or hate speech can end in a ban; no spam or off-topic. 3. <strong>Account security:</strong> remove unnecessary wealth/items before the service; Kings Boosting is not responsible for any loss of wealth or items; the client provides gear and supplies; changing the password before and after the service is recommended, and when the booster changes or there is a refund; they are not responsible for problems before, during or after delivery. 4. <strong>Boosting process:</strong> everything through the Ticket System; the client may log into their account during the service if agreed, but the Booster has priority; services done by hand (no automation); they are not responsible for infractions, bans or mutes; <strong>Parsec +50% unless the listing or the ticket state otherwise</strong>. 5. <strong>Loot and splits:</strong> all loot belongs to the client unless a specific agreement. 6. <strong>Deadlines:</strong> times are estimates. 7. <strong>Payment, wallet credit, GP and refunds:</strong> 7.1 Full payment in advance before starting; real-money payments only to the bot's official addresses given by the Owner; staff only verify the payment proof; GP payments are only collected by the Owner, Admin(s) or Ticket Support, never directly to a Booster unless the address is expressly confirmed. 7.2 USD ($) and OSRS GP are accepted; internal tracking is in USD; paying in USD → the ticket and the credit match the USD price; paying in GP → the ticket's USD value does not change and the GP is calculated at the market selling price at the time of payment (final and non-negotiable). ToS example: a $20 service with GP at $0.15 per 1M → $20 is paid in USD; in GP ~133.33M GP, and the ticket stays $20. 7.3 <strong>All gold transactions are final and non-refundable once completed; GP buys and sells do not count toward Total Spent.</strong> 7.4 <strong>Refunds only if they cannot complete the service, and only for the uncompleted part; once the service has started, no refund unless approved by management.</strong> 8. <strong>Prohibited activities:</strong> self-promotion, advertising or external links without the Owner's approval; deals outside the ticket system can end in a permanent ban and loss of remaining credit. 9. <strong>Hardcore:</strong> they are not responsible for HCIM/HCGIM deaths during services; at your own risk. 10. <strong>Liability:</strong> they are not liable for game bugs, disconnections or unwanted experiences (HCIM deaths, lost items, rollbacks); in a dispute, their liability does not exceed the value of the service purchased; they may refuse or cancel a service if the terms are violated or no Booster accepts the order. 11. <strong>Updates:</strong> the terms may change at any time and apply immediately to new orders.\n- The <strong>FAQ</strong> (19 Mar 2026, Fiziev, Founder | Owner) adds: refunds only if the service has not started or cannot be completed; prices may vary by gear/stats/supplies; loot belongs to the client; pay only verified staff members; booster recruitment in #📝︱apply-to-us.",
    "b_0063": "<strong>Method warning:</strong> during the extraction session the OSRS Machines price list was not available to make a line-by-line comparison; therefore, this section gathers the Tons of XP services that are new or niche content and that typically do not appear in other servers' generic lists, with their price, so they can be compared. It is not a verified difference against the Machines list.\n- CoX Megascales: 60% purple chance $95.00/raid (475M GP); Guaranteed purple $125.00/raid (625M GP, the client provides chinchompas); Guaranteed, no chinchompas $155.00/raid (775M GP); Guaranteed, one scroll protected $255.00/raid (1.27B GP); Guaranteed, both scrolls protected $370.00/raid (1.85B GP); 3 raids with 10% discount. Mystics Chinning: $15.00/session (~700k Ranged XP, ~30 min; the client provides 1.000–1.500 red/black chinchompas, prayer potions and gear).\n- Yama Contracts: 5 contracts $25.00–$30.00 each, all 5 for $100.00; Radiant Oathplate $100.00; Shard $30.00; Familiar (Yama pet) $8.00/fight.\n- Blood Torva (Awakened DT2): 4 bosses $25.00–$30.00, all 4 for $90.00.\n- Dizana's Quiver: Main/Ironman from $50.00, Zerker $69.00, Pure $89.00.\n- Pete Kayer Challenge: from $30.00.\n- The Fractured Archive (Raids 4): Login $14.00/run, Carry $20.00/run, Parsec +60%.\n- New bosses per kill: Doom of Mokhaiotl from $19.95 (PvM $3.10/kill), Yama from $4.00 (PvM $0.75/kill), Corrupted Gauntlet from $7.00 (PvM $0.90/kill).\n- Ironman gathering per unit (complete catalogue of ~90 services: ores, logs, herbs, secondaries, Karambwan $0.05, Anglerfish $0.10, Amethyst $0.05, etc. — see A5).\n- Combat achievements: 97 bundles per boss and «Reach a tier» per point (see A8).\n- PvM coaching: $19.95/60 minutes.\n- Minigames of new/niche content: Vale Totems from $0.60, Barracuda Trials / Pirate Port from $1.50, Mastering Mixology from $0.10, Hunter Rumours from $0.20, Golem Crafting from $0.10, Deep Sea Trawling from $0.10, Volcanic Mine from $0.10, Forestry from $2.00, Shooting Stars/stardust, Sailing (Gwenith Glide, Pirate Port), Perilous Moons, Soul Wars, Player-owned house Setup from $4.00, Bank Organisation $8.00, Scroll of Imbuing $6.00, Gout Tuber $5.00, Zalcano $0.40/kill, Mahogany Homes from $0.10.\n- Skill calculator by method/XP (e.g. Wealthy Citizens, Calcified Rocks, Motherlode) with a price per level bracket, no fixed price.",
