    "b_0068": "<strong>Ambiguous / no clear unit:</strong> TOA Speed-Runner III Parsec $80 is neither +30% of the $60 Boost nor of the $68 Login. «Bulk KC = $35 / 215m» (bundles, Quiver) with no clear unit. TOA KC $1.5/$2/$3.5 with no /kc suffix, unlike COX. LMS PTS $0.19 with no explicit unit. «Sandmining w/o … $1.1k per 1k» likely a typo. «+DT1 $50 total» (Account Builds) ambiguous. «Sportsmanship - Quiver» with no explicit extra amount.",
