    "b_0078": "<strong>Barbarian Assault (!m ba; Simmat 29/07/26, notepad; None):</strong> Fighter Torso $12.80/$14.08; Penance Skirt $12.80/$14.08; Hat $8.40/$9.24; Gloves $6.40/$7.04; Boots $6.40/$7.04; Per Round $3.20/$3.52; Granite Body $3.20/$3.52; All Lvl 5 Roles $40.00/$44.00; High Gambles $3.50/$3.85; Low Gamble $1.50/$1.65; 50+ High Gambles $2.50/$2.75; Full BA Set w/ 1 Hat $46.80/$51.48; Full BA Set w/ 4 Hats $93.60/$102.96. (Leech prices in the bot's reply: torso/skirt $25.60, hat $16.80, gloves/boots $12.80, round $6.40.)",
    "b_0079": "<strong>Barbarian Assault:</strong> Leech +20%. Queen kill $6.80. Fighter Torso $24.65. Penance Skirt $24.65. Hat $14.45. Gloves $14.45. Runner Boots $14.45. Level 5 in each role $24.65 (per role). All roles $85. High Gamble $7.65. Type !m ba in #calculation-bot.",
    "b_0080": "<strong>Barbarian Assault:</strong> notes: All orders can be completed in a single session (except bulk gambles); No cooldowns are required, though sessions can be split if you prefer. Surcharges: Low HP (≤20) +25%; Login +15%; Parsec +50%. Queen Kill – Leech $6.25; High Gamble – Leech $8.34 (50x High Gambles ➜ 2.5% Off; 75x ➜ 5% Off; 100x ➜ 10% Off); Runner Boots – Leech $6.78; Penance Gloves – Leech $10.00; Any Hat – Leech $18.44; Fighter Torso – Leech $25.00; Penance Skirt – Leech $25.00; Level 5 in a Role – Leech $25.00; Level 5 in All Roles – Leech $83.34; No Kandarin Hard Diary ➜ +10%.",
    "b_0081": "<strong>Barbarian Assault</strong> (pricing depends on presence of basic equipment): Fighter Torso 45m; Penance Skirt 40m; Any Hat 35m; Penance Gloves 35m; Runner Boots 35m; Queen Kill 15m; Level 5 Role 55m; All Level 5 Roles 180 [no unit published].",
    "b_0082": "<strong>Birdhouse Runs</strong> (per run): Single Birdhouse Run $0.35; Bundle – 25+ Birdhouse Run $0.28.",
    "b_0083": "<strong>Blast Furnace Smithing/Ores Buying:</strong> Steel Bar $0.0008 | 4.21K. Mithril Bar $0.0012 | 6.32K. Adamantite Bar $0.0016 | 8.42K. Runite Bar $0.002 | 10.53K (each, per bar). Cannon Ball – Per Bar $0.0025 | 13.16K. Buying Ores – Each $0.001 | 5.26K. All: No staminas +25% | No graceful +25%. Req: Ores + Ice Gloves + Graceful (Cannon Ball: Steel Bars + Graceful; Buying Ores: Graceful).",
    "b_0084": "<strong>Blast Furnace:</strong> Buying Ore from Blast Furnace Shop — Gold, Coal, Mithril, Iron 2.75k each (in the source it reads «Gold, Cold»); Coal with Coal Bag 2k each. Smithing Bars — Steel Bars (Coal Bag, Graceful, Staminas) 4k each; Mithril Bars 5k each; Adamantite Bars 7.5k each; Runite Bars 9.37k each; Gold Bars (Graceful and Staminas) 4k each; Cannonballs (Smelting Steel Bars into Cannonballs) 6.25k per Steel Bar. Daeyalt Essence 60 Mining 775 gp per essence.",
    "b_0085": "<strong>Blood Torva</strong> — /services/blood-torva: full bundle from $85 Login (max gear) / $115 Parsec; individual Login: Vardorvis from $26. Duke Sucellus from $22. The Whisperer from $22. The Leviathan from $26. Parsec / without max gear: small surcharge (not broken down per individual in the summary).",
    "b_0086": "<strong>Blue Dragon Bones:</strong> $0.017 with 70 Agility vs $0.016 without it (more expensive meeting the requirement).",
    "b_0087": "<strong>Bones Collecting</strong> (content title: «Efficient Dragon Farming for Ironman»): Green Dragons 175k each; Blue Dragons (70+ Agility) 137.5k each; Blue Dragons (Less than 70 Agility) 155k each.",
