    "b_0102": "<strong>Channel:</strong> #💎︱services-and-pricing — OSRS Machines Server 🦾\n<strong>Link:</strong> https://discord.com/channels/1300461970549641236/1300471271569752095\n<strong>Channel topic:</strong> «Explore our full services and pricing — everything you need in one place!»\n<strong>Source:</strong> 3 messages from Machines staff, from 10/10/26. No pinned messages. Extraction finished on 8 November 2026.\n<strong>All prices are in US dollars (USD), as published.</strong>\n<strong>Reading:</strong> read-only, no message, reaction or interaction was sent on the server.",
    "b_0103": "<strong>Channel:</strong> #💵︱prices — https://ptb.discord.com/channels/1441842044480913482/1442423729920409670",
    "b_0104": "<strong>Castle Wars (!m cw 100; Jord 01/12/25; 10.0% discount):</strong> Per Ticket $14.54/$15.99.",
