    "b_0147": "<strong>Delve:</strong> there is no Delve raid service in the Raids menu, but there ARE Guaranteed Delve Drops (Avernic Treads, Eye of Ayak, Mokhaiotl Cloth, $490/$580).",
    "b_0148": "<strong>Delve</strong> complete per oleadas (Wave 1-4 a 1-12) and their CAs Master/Grandmaster (Doom, Mokhaiotl, etc.).",
    "b_0149": "<strong>Demonic Gorilla Tanking:</strong> $4.40 per hour.",
    "b_0150": "<strong>Bulk discounts:</strong> Dizana's Quiver 5x → 10% Off, 10x → 20% Off; Corrupted Gauntlet per KC 50+ 2% / 100+ 4% / 200+ 6% / 400+ 8% / 500+ 10%; Barbarian Assault High Gamble 50x 2.5% / 75x 5% / 100x 10%; Pet Boosting: free KC for bulk (see §A11); Birdhouse Run 25+ at $0.28.",
    "b_0151": "<strong>Desert Treasure 2</strong> (per kill, Max gear): Leviathan kills $0.26. Vardorvis kills $0.24. Duke kills $0.20. Whisperer kills $0.29. «Upcharges are possible for changes in gear &amp; stats». Type !b dt2 in #calculation-bot.",
    "b_0152": "<strong>Diaries:</strong> NO PRICE; only !m commands: Ardougne !m ardougne, Desert !m desert, Falador !m falador, Fremennik !m fremennik, Kandarin !m kandarin, Karamja !m karamja, Kourend !m kourend, Lumbridge !m lumbridge, Morytania !m morytania, Varrock !m varrock, Western province !m wp, Wilderness !m wilderness.",
    "b_0153": "<strong>Diaries:</strong> several tiers include requirements at a separate cost (Ardougne Elite: 800K NMZ Pts; Kandarin Elite: Lvl 5 All Role at BA $25; Karamja Medium: 25M for gout tuber; Kourend Elite: dark totem &amp; CoX kc; Lumbridge Hard: 55m for Bones to peaches; Western Provinces Elite with Chompy Kills $13.00 vs $5.00 without them).",
    "b_0154": "<strong>Diary Cape From Scratch (Ironman):</strong> the diaries tab lists <strong>$280</strong> and the Diary Cape Pack tab lists <strong>$2800</strong>; the Normal one matches at $1400 in both.",
    "b_0155": "<strong>Dizana's Quiver</strong> — /services/quiver, from $45: base $45 (assumes Tbow/Scythe + Fang + Venator Bow). No Tbow/Scythe +$10. No Fang +10% (only without Tbow/Scythe). No Venator Bow +15%. Custom time +20%. Parsec +30%. 5+ quivers 30% off each (after surcharges).",
