    "b_0159": "<strong>Doom of Mokhaiotl:</strong> The Final Dawan Quest 50m; Delve lvl 1-4 clear 5m ($1,50); Delve lvl 1-6 clear 12m ($3,60); Delve lvl 1-8 clear 21m ($6,30). Max gear + stats req: Tbow, ZCB, Void or Masori, max range, Emberlight, Scorching Bow + Purging Staff. Surcharges: No Rigour +5% | No ZCB +5% | No Tbow +5% | Below 90 Range &amp; Defence +5%.",
