    "b_0168": "<strong>Elf &amp; Vyre:</strong> x1k Master Farmer [38-70] Thieving $1.60 | 8.42M, No Ardougne Hard Diary +10% | No Seed Box +20%. [70-85] $1.17 | 6.16M, No Ardougne Hard Diary +10%. [85-98] $0.93 | 4.89M, No Ardougne Hard Diary +10%. x1k Pickpocket Vyres w\\90 thieving $7.50 | 39.47M, Reqs: Ardy Hard 3/Shadow Veil Spell/Dodge necklace, Missing Caption Reqs +10%. x1k Pickpocket Vyres Below 90 Thieving $11.00 | 57.89M, same reqs, Missing +15%. x1k Pickpocketing elves w\\ 90 Thieving $9.00 | 47.37M, same reqs, Below 90 Thieving +35%.",
    "b_0169": "<strong>Elite — 161 tasks (79 new «Misc»; 82 already in §F1).</strong>\nNew: Abyssal Sire: Abyssal Veteran $15.00. Demonic Rebound $6.00. Perfect Sire $2.00. Respiratory Runner $2.00. Alchemical Hydra: Alchemical Veteran $17.00. Amoxliatl: Amoxliatl Speed-Chaser $5.00. Without Ralos' Light $2.00. Araxxor: Araxxor Speed-Trialist $8.00. Araxxor Veteran $10.00. Relaxxor $5.00. Basilisk Knight: Reflecting on This Encounter $1.20. Callisto: Callisto Veteran $7.80. Cerberus: Anti-Bite Mechanics $2.00. Cerberus Veteran $16.00. Ghost Buster $2.00. Unrequired Antifire $2.00. Chaos Elemental: Chaos Elemental Veteran $9.50. Corporeal Beast: Chicken Killer $5.00. Corporeal Beast Veteran $35.00. Finding Weak Spot $3.00. Hot on Your Feet $3.00. Dagannoth Kings: Death to the Seer King $4.00. From One King to Another $6.00. Death to the Warrior King $4.00. Toppling the Diarchy $6.00. Death to the Archer King $6.00. Rapid Succession $6.00. Demonic Gorilla: Hitting Them Where It Hurts $1.50. If Gorillas Could Fly $1.00. Fragment of Seren: Fragment of Seren Speed-Trialist $6.00. Galvek: Galvek Speed-Trialist $6.00. Giant Mole: Hard Hitter $4.00. Glough: Glough Speed-Trialist $6.00. Grotesque Guardians: Done before Dusk $3.00. From Dusk... $5.00. Grotesque Guardians Speed-Trialist $7.00. Grotesque Guardians Veteran $14.00. Perfect Grotesque Guardians $10.00. Hespori: Hespori Speed-Trialist $4.00. Plant-Based Diet $3.00. Kalphite Queen: Insect Deflection $3.00. Kalphite Queen Veteran $22.00. Prayer Smasher $3.00. Kraken: Ten-tacles $10.00. Mad Angel (Sol Heredit): The Pen is Mightier $2.00. This is Madness $5.00. Maggot King: Trying to fit in $4.00. Moons of Peril: High Hitter $4.00. Phantom Muspah: Can't Escape $2.00. Phantom Muspah Speed-Trialist $9.00. Phantom Muspah Veteran $11.30. Versatile Drainer $3.00. Royal Titans: No time to pray $4.00. Scorpia: Scorpia Veteran $9.40. Skotizo: Demon Evasion $5.00. Up for the Challenge $3.00. Hueycoatl: Hueycoatl Speed-Trialist $4.00. Hueycoatl Veteran $9.00. Perfect Hueycoatl $4.00. Mimic: Mimic Veteran $3.00. Thermonuclear Smoke Devil: Hazard Prevention $5.00. Spec'd Out $5.00. Thermonuclear Smoke Devil Veteran $6.00. Tormented Demons: Rapid Reload $2.00. Through Fire and Flames $2.00. Two Times the Torment $3.00. Unending Torment $2.00. TzHaar-Ket-Rak's Challenges: Facing Jad Head-on III $5.00. The II Jad Challenge $3.00. TzHaar-Ket-Rak's Speed-Trialist $5.00. TzTok-Jad: A Near Miss! $5.00. Facing Jad Head-on $7.00. Fight Caves Veteran $8.00. Venenatis: Venenatis Veteran $8.00. Vet'ion: Vet'eran $7.00. Zalcano: Perfect Zalcano $7.50. Team Player $5.00. The Spurned Hero $5.00. Zalcano Veteran $11.00.\nAlready in §F1 (82): CoX 12, ToA 13, ToB 11, Gauntlet 7, GWD 8, DT2 9 (Duke Adept $1.00, Speed-Trialist $8.00; Vardorvis Adept $3.00, Speed-Trialist $10.00; Leviathan Adept $1.00, Speed-Trialist $3.00; Whisperer Adept $2.00, Speed-Trialist $6.00, Tentacular $5.00), Nightmare/Phosani 6, Yama 3, Nex 2, Zulrah 4, Vorkath 3, Inferno 1 (Half-Way There $30.00), Colosseum 3.",
    "b_0170": "<strong>In Corrupted Gauntlet,</strong> the first partial view of the prayers box was cut off and the values were confirmed in a second complete view: 75+ = $1.155, 80+ = $1.05, 85+ = $0.903, 90+ = $0.756, 95+ = $0.693, 99 = $0.63.",
