    "b_0216": "<strong>God Wars Dungeon — 31 tasks (4 bosses).</strong>\nGeneral Graardor (8): Hard — Graardor Adept $20.00. General Showdown $4.00. Ourg Freezer $4.00. Elite — Graardor Veteran $40.50. Ourg Freezer II $5.00. Grandmaster — Graardor: Defence Matters $20.00. Keep Away $13.00. Ourg Killer $25.00.\nKree'arra (7): Hard — Airborne Showdown $4.00. Kree'arra Adept $33.00. Elite — Kree'arra Veteran $62.00. Master — Collateral Damage $9.00. Swoop No More $9.00. Grandmaster — Feather Hunter $45.00. The Worst Ranged Weapon $15.00.\nCommander Zilyana (7): Hard — Commander Showdown $1.00. Zilyana Adept $23.00. Elite — Zilyana Veteran $45.00. Reminisce $7.50. Master — Moving Collateral $7.50. Grandmaster — Animal Whisperer $10.00. Peach Conjurer $40.00.\nK'ril Tsutsaroth (9): Hard — Demonbane Weaponry II $4.00. Demonic Showdown $4.00. K'ril Tsutsaroth Adept $24.00. Yarr No More $4.00. Elite — Demonic Defence $7.00. K'ril Tsutsaroth Veteran $43.00. Bane of Demons $7.00. Grandmaster — Ash Collector $20.00. Demon Whisperer $13.00.\nNote: the «God Wars 23 tasks $205» bundle equals these 31 minus the 8 Adept/Veteran tasks (2 per boss).",
