    "b_0222": "<strong>Grandmaster — 122 tasks (20 new «Misc»; 102 already in §F1).</strong>\nNew: Alchemical Hydra: Alchemical Speed-Runner $13.00. No Pressure $13.00. Araxxor: Araxxor Speed-Runner $10.00. Perfect Araxxor 2 $8.00. Swimming in Venom $5.00. Grotesque Guardians: Grotesque Guardians Speed-Runner $10.00. Maggot King: Maggot King Speed Chaser $25.00. Phantom Muspah: Phantom Muspah Manipulator $14.00. Phantom Muspah Speed-Runner $20.00. Hueycoatl: Hueycoatl Speed-Runner $12.00 (kill the Hueycoatl in 2:30 with three or fewer players). TzHaar-Ket-Rak's Challenges: It Wasn't a Fluke $18.00. The VI Jad Challenge $7.00. TzHaar-Ket-Rak's Speed-Runner $15.00. TzKal-Zuk: Facing Jad Head-on II $80.00. Jad? What Are You Doing Here? $55.00. No Luck Required $55.00. TzTok-Jad: Denying the Healers II $9.00. Fight Caves Speed-Runner $12.00. No Time for a Drink $35.00. Whisperer: Whispered $22.00 (kill the Awakened Whisperer; not to be confused with «Dark Memories» $6.00).\nAlready in §F1 (102): CoX 8, ToA 12, ToB 20, Gauntlet 4, Colosseum 5, Doom 7, GWD 9, DT2 13, Nightmare/Phosani 8, Yama 3, Nex 3, Zulrah 1, Vorkath 3, Inferno 7.",
