    "b_0241": "<strong>Herblore:</strong> single route Optimal Potions $67.75: 1-38 (XP 30,408; $/XP 0.0000250776; $0.76), 38-63 (338,191; 0.0000232839; $7.87), 63-81 (1,824,219; 0.0000047961; $8.75), 81-99 (10,841,613; 0.0000046458; $50.37).",
    "b_0242": "<strong>Sythe price threads NOT read (Cloudflare block):</strong> at the bottom of the vouches thread, under \"Similar threads\", Kings Boosting has 5 of its own price threads (created 13 Feb 2026, ~1,531–1,532 replies, last activity 9 Nov 2026, 6:14 AM): Premium Questing Services, Premium Skilling Services, All Minigame Services, Buy OSRS GP From Us Service, Sell OSRS GP To Us Service. The bot-challenge agent made ~12 attempts with different methods in two tabs (t4 and t5) and did not get past Cloudflare's Turnstile on those threads (tab t4 got stuck on \"Un momento…\" and no environment replacement was left available in this task). <strong>Their prices could not be compared with Discord's; they remain the only pending part.</strong> Verified URL of the questing thread: https://www.sythe.org/threads/star-300-donorhigh-voltagewhere-kings-are-crownedhigh-voltagepremium-questing-serviceshigh-voltagelogin-vpn-parsecstar/",
