    "b_0244": "<strong>Hueycoatl (!b huey 100; rosi 31/08/26; 10.0% discount):</strong> Mass $0.13/kill ($11.34/$12.47); 3-5 Teams $0.25 ($22.68/$24.95); Solo $0.70 ($63.00/$69.30).",
    "b_0245": "<strong>Impetuous Impulses (!m impet 100; Drizzwold 25/07/26; 20.0% discount):</strong> Mixing Jars $0.32/$0.35 per jar; Young/Eclectic $0.77/$0.84 per imp; Ninja/Magpie $1.54/$1.69; Dragon $128.00/$140.80; Crystal $128.00/$140.80; Lucky $256.00/$281.60.",
