    "b_0299": "<strong>Mastering Mixology separately</strong> (amulet/outfit/goggles/pouch/storage/barrel) and <strong>Giants Foundry per point</strong> by Smithing tier (§A3).",
    "b_0300": "<strong>Mastering Mixology:</strong> notes: Listed prices assume 81+ herblore. Prescription Goggles $21.50; Alchemist Labcoat $8.50; Alchemist Pants $8.50; Alchemist Gloves $10.00; Reagent Pouch $25.00; Potion Storage $18.00; Chugging Barrel $35.00; Alchemist's Amulet $17.00; Aldarium $0.30.",
    "b_0301": "<strong>Medium — 58 tasks (all new).</strong>\nAmoxliatl: Amoxliatl Champion $1.00. Temotli Triumph $2.00. Barrows: Barrows Champion $12.00. Can't Touch Me $2.00. Pray for Success $1.00. Brutal Black Dragon: Brutal, Big, Black and Firey $1.00. Bryophyta: Bryophyta Champion $20.00. Quick Cutter $0.50. Chaos Fanatic: Chaos Fanatic Champion $4.00. Sorry, What Was That? $2.00. Crazy Archaeologist: Crazy Archaeologist Champion $3.50. I'd Rather Not Learn $2.00. Mage of the Ruins $0.50. Dagannoth Kings: Dagannoth Prime Champion $5.50. A Frozen King $2.00. Dagannoth Rex Champion $5.50. Dagannoth Supreme Champion $5.50. Deranged Archaeologist: Deranged Archaeologist Champion $10.00. I'd Rather Be Illiterate $2.00. Mage of the Swamp $2.00. Gargoyle: A Smashing Time $1.00. Giant Mole: Avoiding Those Little Arms $3.00. Giant Mole Champion $6.00. King Black Dragon: Antifire Protection $3.00. Claw Clipper $3.00. Hide Penetration $3.00. King Black Dragon Champion $9.00. Kurask: Master of Broad Weaponry $1.00. Mad Angel (Sol Heredit): Dancing Queen $1.00. Juggling Act $1.00. Smite Fight $1.00. Moons of Peril: Back to Our Roots $3.00. Lunar Triplet $2.00. Moons of Peril Speed-Trialist $5.00. Perilous Novice $6.00. Thralls (no boss/area on the page): Sit Back and Relax $5.00 (deal 100 damage with undead thralls). Obor: Back to the Wall $3.00. Obor Champion $8.00. Squashing the Giant $1.00. Royal Titans: It takes too long $4.00. Royal Titan Adept $8.50. Royal Titan Champion $4.00. Sarachnis: Newspaper Enthusiast $3.00. Sarachnis Champion $7.50. Scurrius: Efficient Pest Control $1.50. Perfect Scurrius $1.50. Scurrius Champion $4.20. Skeletal Wyvern: A Frozen Foe from the Past $1.00. Skotizo: Demonbane Weaponry $3.60. Demonic Weakening $3.00. Skotizo Champion $2.50. Tempoross: Tempoross Champion $7.00. The Lone Angler $4.00. Hueycoatl: Hueycoatl Champion $2.50. You're a wizard $3.00. Wintertodt: Can We Fix It? $2.00. Leaving No One Behind $2.00. Wintertodt Champion $8.00.",
    "b_0302": "<strong>Megascale with scroll protection</strong> ($220 Arcane, $320 Arcane &amp; Dexterous) and Mystics Chinning $15/session — cheaper than TONS ($125/$155/$255/$370, chinning $15) and Bald ($180/$198/$260/$370, chinning $26).",
    "b_0303": "<strong>Megascale</strong> (ToA service): MegaScale – 100% Purple Chance With Chins $100.00 | 526.32M. Without Chins $130.00 | 684.21M. 100% Arcane Scroll Protection $220.00 | 1.16B. 100% Arcane &amp; Dexterous Protection $320.00 | 1.68B. Ranged Training – Mystics Chinning $15.00 | 78.95M.",
