    "b_0340": "<strong>Other surcharges (per service, see sections):</strong> Without Rigour +$5 (Infernal Main) / +30% (Fire Main) / +5% (Doom); Without Blowpipe +$10; Without Sara Brews +10%; Without Ranging Potions +10%; Without Eagle Eye +40% (Zerker) / +50% (Pure); Without Scorching Bow +$5 (Yama Contracts, Sensory Clouding); Without Tbow +10% / Without ZCB +10% / Below 90 Ranged &amp; Defence +5% (Doom); Titan Prayers +5% / Standard Prayers +10% (Corrupted Gauntlet); No Shadow +15% (ToA 300+); Item Gathering +20% / Without Staminas +10% (Questing); Low HP (≤20) +25% / No Kandarin Hard Diary +10% (Barbarian Assault); No Lunar Spell +15% (Tithe Farm); Without Humidify +15% / Fishing Level Below 50 +10% (Tempoross); Without Graceful +15% (Herbiboar); Without Fish Eater +2% (CoX Megascales); Without BP +20% (Guaranteed Delve Drops); No Goldsmith Gauntlets +35% (Smithing Path 1); W/O Ardougne Hard Diary +10% / W/O Seed Box +15% (Master Farmer); Cooking +30% (Food Supplies); Gout Tuber +$5 (Karamja Diary); Bones to Peaches +$12 (Lumbridge &amp; Draynor Diary); BA Queen Kill +$6.875 and BA Level 5 all roles +$91.674 (Kandarin Diary); Black Knight Kill +$0.003/kill (Falador Diary); Chompy Kill +$0.0165/kill (Western Provinces Diary).",
