    "b_0432": "<strong>Smithing:</strong> The Knight's Sword Quest [1-29] $0.40; Best Bars [29-40] $0.36 / $0.40; Blast Furnance w/ Gold Gauntlets [40-99] $99.82 / $109.80 (as written, \"Furnance\", in the bot's reply); Best Platebodies [40-99] $124.77 / $137.25; Darts/Knives [40-99] $207.96 / $228.75.",
    "b_0433": "<strong>Smithing:</strong> note on Path 1: \"1st Path Upcharge: No Goldsmith Gauntlets ➜ +35%\". Path 1 $129.00: 1-40 (XP 37,224; $/XP 0.00004152; $1.55), Blast Furnace – Gold Bars W/ Goldsmith Gauntlets 40-70 (700,403; 0.0000118465; $8.30), 70-99 (12,296,804; 0.00000969; $119.16). Path 2 $164.13: 1-40 (37,224; 0.00004152; $1.55), Best Platebodies 40-70 (700,403; 0.00001566075; $10.97), 70-99 (12,296,804; 0.00001233005; $151.62).",
    "b_0434": "<strong>Soul Wars (!m sw 1000; Splash 06/06/26; 8.0% discount):</strong> 1-2500 Zeal per zeal $13.98/$15.38; 2500+ Zeal $12.51/$13.76; No HP Method (Obby Build) $16.19/$17.81.",
