    "b_0440": "<strong>TFA (The Fractured Archive) IS published</strong> in the Raids menu: Login 5+ Man $8 / 4 Man $10 / 3 Man $12 / Duo $14 / Solo $18 per KC; Carry/Leech 4+1 $9.60 / 3+1 $12 / 2+1 $14.40 / 1+1 $18.20. Most other servers do not publish it.",
    "b_0441": "<strong>TFA via Carry/Leech</strong> (prices may vary by gear &amp; stats; <strong>Parsec not stated in the ephemeral</strong>): 4+1 W/ Max Gear $9.60; 3+1 $12.00; 2+1 $14.40; 1+1 $18.20.",
    "b_0442": "<strong>TFA via Login</strong> (prices may vary by gear &amp; stats, Parsec +50%): 5+ Man – W/ Max Gear $8.00; 4 Man $10.00; 3 Man $12.00; Duo $14.00; Solo $18.00.",
    "b_0443": "<strong>TFA and Pete Kayer are confirmed as market prices.</strong> Kings publishes TFA Login Duo $14 / Solo $18 and Pete Kayer Final Boss $35 / full $50 — the same $35/$50 as Bald. Radiant Oathplate $65 at Kings (Lorax $57, Bald $100). Three servers agree on Pete Kayer, so if Machines adds it, $35/$50 is the price to copy.",
    "b_0444": "<strong>TOA KC:</strong> price changes with invocation, gear and stats; Fang kit +$10 without yellow keris.",
    "b_0445": "<strong>Ironman/HCIM percentage rate:</strong> does not exist as a % surcharge in the lists; the Ironman markup is fixed in Account Builds, and the Hardcore Worlds one is +25% (announcement).",
    "b_0446": "<strong>Tempoross (!m temp 100; ParsecFlight 25/10/26; None):</strong> Normal Harpoon per permit $6.40/$7.04; Dragon $5.92/$6.51; Crystal $5.60/$6.16; Infernal $5.28/$5.81. Ref with 4.0% discount (Trioculate 25/10/26): $6.14/$6.76; $5.68/$6.25; $5.38/$5.91; $5.07/$5.58.",
    "b_0447": "<strong>Tempoross (Per Permit, Fishing tab): (35-99) Normal Harpoon $0.0609 Per Permit, (61-99) Dragon Harpoon $0.0563 Per Permit, (71-99) Crystal Harpoon $0.0533 Per Permit, (75-99) Infernal Harpoon $0.0502 Per Permit.</strong> (See discrepancy with the Minigames tab at the end.)",
