    "b_0454": "<strong>Theatre of Blood (ToB)</strong> — /services/theatre-of-blood, from $4.25/run.\n- Login/Parsec Normal: 3-man $5.15. 4-man $4.25.\n- Login/Parsec Hard Mode: $5.95/run (no gear selector in the calculator).\n- Carry Normal: 4-man $5.55. 5-man $6.76.\n- Carry Hard Mode: 4-man $9.55. 5-man $12.35.\n- Parsec +50%. Discounts: 15+ runs 10% off. 30+ runs 15% off. Pot boosting: $4.00 per potion.",
    "b_0455": "<strong>Theatre of Blood:</strong> TOB Logins — Standard ToB with Scythe 14m/kc ($4,20); Standard ToB Whip &amp; Blade 16m/kc. Hard Mode Logins — Standard HMT with Scythe 25m/kc. Standard TOB Carries — 2 Boosters + Client (trio) 13m/kc; 3 Boosters + Client (4man) 16m/kc. Same Additional Charges as CoX (No Rigour/Augury +500k, Sub 90 +500k, Sub 80 +1.5m, No BGS/D truncated).",
