    "b_0473": "<strong>ToB: Hard Mode</strong> (only line seen): 4-Man Login W/ Max Melee Gear + Scythe $5.90. Notes: if the required time is achieved (for Dust/Kit), the raid counts as a completed KC; if the time is not achieved but a rare drop is received, it also counts as a KC.",
