    "b_0477": "<strong>Tombs of Amascut (ToA) — 50 tasks.</strong>\nHard: Confident Raider $4.00. Movin' on up $3.00. Novice Tomb Explorer $4.00. Novice Tomb Looter $85.00.\nElite: Down Do Specs $5.00. Dropped the ball $3.00. Hardcore Raiders $9.00. Hardcore Tombs $8.20. Helpful spirit who? $5.00. I'm in a rush $3.00. No skipping allowed $3.00. Perfect Apmeken $4.00. Perfect Crondis $2.20. Perfect Het $4.50. Tomb Explorer $5.00. Novice Tomb Raider $200.00. Expert Tomb Explorer $6.00.\nMaster: Better get movin' $13.00. Chompington $3.00. Perfect Akkha $18.00. Perfect Ba-Ba $4.00. Perfect Kephri $4.00. Perfect Scabaras $3.00. Perfect Wardens $26.00. Perfect Zebak $5.00. Tomb Looter $50.00. Tomb Raider $100.00. You are not prepared $12.00. All out of medics $12.00. Ba-Bananza $14.00. But... Damage $37.00. Doesn't bug me $22.00. Expert Tomb Looter $90.00. Fancy feet $22.00. Resourceful Raider $20.00. Rockin' around the croc $8.00. Something of an expert myself $7.00. Warden't you believe it $8.00.\nGrandmaster: Akkhan't Do it $13.00. All Praise Zebak $24.00. Amascut's Remnant $50.00. Expert Tomb Raider $178.00. Insanity $40.00. Maybe I'm the boss $24.00. Perfection of Apmeken $8.00. Perfection of Crondis $7.00. Perfection of Het $23.00. Perfection of Scabaras $7.00. Tombs Speed Runner II $60.00. Tombs Speed Runner III $68.00.",
    "b_0478": "<strong>Tombs of Amascut (ToA)</strong> — /services/tombs-of-amascut, from $2.25/run. Per invocation (150–400): 150 $2.25. 200 $2.80. 250 $2.99. 300 $3.92. 350 $4.47. 400 $6.17. Parsec +50%; 15+ runs 10% off. Fang Kit: $50 (both items). +$10 if no Yellow Keris. +$15 if no Shadow. Total $50–$75 before Parsec. Thread of Elidinis: $30.",
    "b_0479": "<strong>Tombs of Amascut:</strong> Entry mode, Shadow+tbow+fang $1.50 (no /kc suffix published). Normal mode (150) $2. Expert mode $3.50. «Prices change depending on your invocation level+gear+stats». «Type !b toa in #💭calculation-bot💭 for pricing. Type !b toa expert for expert». Cosmetic kits: Masori kit $4.50. Ward $15. Fang $50 (+$10 if no yellow keris). Any Transmog $40.",
    "b_0480": "<strong>Tombs of Amascut:</strong> Normal (200) — Rapier/Fang/Hasta 12m/kc, Whip 13.5m/kc. Normal (250) — Rapier/Fang/Hasta 14m/kc, Whip 14.5m/kc. Expert (300) — Rapier/Fang 15m/kc, Hasta 18m/kc. Expert (350) — Ava's Kit First kc 35M, Rapier or Fang + Max Gear 18m/kc. Expert (400) — Fang + Max Gear Shadow 22m/kc. Invo (450) — Zebak, Akkha, Ba-ba 125m each, Kephri 150m. Ornament Kits — ToA Elidinis' Ward Ward Kit 425 Raid Level 150M; Fang Kit 500 Invocations 250m/kc with Shadow + Max Gear. Same Additional Charges as CoX/ToB.",
    "b_0481": "<strong>Published totals (verified sum):</strong> All Easy 49M ($14,70); All Medium 82M ($24,60); All Hard 120M ($36,00); All Elite 137M ($41,10); Total All 388M ($116,40).",
