    "b_0489": "<strong>Volcanic Ash:</strong> $0.0006 | 3.16K (Amethyst) vs $1.3e-07 | 0.68 (Misc Gathering).",
    "b_0490": "<strong>Vorkath — 11 tasks.</strong>\nElite: Stick 'em With the Pointy End $4.00. Vorkath Veteran $15.00. Zombie Destroyer $2.50.\nMaster: Dodging the Dragon $8.00. Extended Encounter $10.00. The Walk $5.00. Vorkath Master $30.00. Vorkath Speed-Chaser $8.60.\nGrandmaster: Faithless Encounter $5.00. The Fremennik Way $9.00. Vorkath Speed-Runner $23.00.",
    "b_0491": "<strong>Wealth &amp; Liability:</strong> withdraw non-essential wealth before starting (no liability for losses); no liability for bans, mutes, HCIM deaths, bugs or server issues; timeframes are estimates, not guarantees; trading with workers outside the server is prohibited and means a ban; violating the terms can cancel the service without refund.",
    "b_0492": "<strong>External website published on the server, www.elite07.com: NOTHING could be extracted</strong> — it did not resolve DNS in the browser (name_not_resolved, tried with and without www, with a retry). It is the exact address published on the server, not a guessed address.",
    "b_0493": "<strong>Web «from»:</strong> Infernal $60 (matches Main Login, not 1 Def $95 or 45 Def $80), Quiver $45 (Main Login), Blood Torva $85 (All 4 Login); Nex from $1.50 and Quests from $0.61 have no fixed price on Discord.",
    "b_0494": "<strong>Western Provinces Diary:</strong> Hard $4.00 costs more than Elite $3.50 (ordering anomaly).",
