    "b_0497": "<strong>Wilderness bosses</strong> (Callisto, Venenatis, Vet'ion, etc.): NO PRICE; only !b callisto, !b artio, !b vetion, !b calvarion, !b venenatis, !b spindel, !b scorpia, !b chaos fanatic, !b chaos elemental, !b crazy archeologist.",
