    "b_0500": "<strong>Yama &amp; Doom of Mokhaiotl:</strong> Yama (Solo) $1.50 | 7.89M, REQ: Emberlight and Purging Staff. Yama (Duo) $0.80 | 4.21M, same REQ. Doom of Mokhaiotl Level 1-4 clear $1.30 | 6.84M, REQ: All Demonbane Weaponry. Level 1-6 $1.80 | 9.47M. Level 1-8 $2.50 | 13.16M.\n<strong>Corrupted Gauntlet:</strong> CG (75+) Combat Stats $0.80 | 4.21M. CG (80+) $0.60 | 3.16M. CG (85+) $0.50 | 2.63M. CG (90+) $0.42 | 2.21M. CG (95+) $0.40 | 2.11M. Normal Gauntlet $0.20 | 1.05M. REQ: Augury &amp; Rigour. Surcharges: No Augury +5%, No Rigour +5%, No Piety +10% (at all CG levels).\n<strong>Godwars Dungeon Bosses:</strong> Nex Mass World $0.16 | 842.11K. K'ril Tsutsaroth $0.18 | 947.37K. Commander Zilyana $0.18 | 947.37K. Kree'arra $0.20 | 1.05M. General Graador $0.20 | 1.05M (as published, «Graador»).\n<strong>Vorkath:</strong> RCB $0.20 | 1.05M. DHCB $0.15 | 789.47K.\n<strong>Zulrah:</strong> Bowfa + Trident $0.17 | 894.74K. Blowpipe + Trident $0.20 | 1.05M.\n<strong>Wilderness Bosses:</strong> Callisto $0.17 | 894.74K. Venenatis $0.16 | 842.11K. Vetion $0.23 | 1.21M. Scorpia $0.10 | 526.32K. Chaos Elemental $0.11 | 578.95K. King Black Dragon $0.14 | 736.84K. Crazy Archaelogist $0.08 | 421.05K (as published, «Archaelogist»). Chaos Fanatic $0.08 | 421.05K.\n<strong>Demonic Gorilla:</strong> On Task $0.07 | 368.42K. Off Task $0.09 | 473.68K.\n<strong>Lizardman Shamans:</strong> [Bowfa-BP] With Cannon $0.04 | 210.53K. Without Cannon $0.06 | 315.79K. [MSB-RCB] With Cannon $0.07 | 368.42K. Without Cannon $0.09 | 473.68K.\n<strong>Dagannoth Kings</strong> (published as «Dagganoth Kings»): Rex $0.09 | 473.68K. Prime $0.09 | 473.68K. Supreme $0.09 | 473.68K. Rotation (3) $0.22 | 1.16M.\n<strong>Kalphite Queen:</strong> Blowpipe &amp; Blue Keris $0.22 | 1.16M. Scythe &amp; Blowpipe $0.26 | 1.37M. Keris or Verac &amp; Rune Cbow $0.45 | 2.37M. Extra 20% if no Diary and Extra 10% if off task (on all three lines).\n<strong>Barrows Chest:</strong> Trident/House $0.22 | 1.16M. Iban's Staff $0.35 | 1.84M.\n<strong>Corporeal Beast:</strong> [Solo] $1.20 | 6.32M — CURRENT VALUE, verified twice in the second session (05:49). DISCREPANCY: in the first pass it showed Solo $0.35 | 1.84M, Duo $0.15 | 789.47K, Trio $0.12 | 631.58K; the bot message was edited that same day and the $1.20-only version is what it publishes now (no Duo/Trio lines). See §D.1.\n<strong>Cerberus:</strong> Med Level Gear $0.10 | 526.32K. High End Gear $0.09 | 473.68K.\n<strong>Alchemical Hydra:</strong> 85+ Range [Tbow] $0.17 | 894.74K. Blowpipe 90+ Range $0.20 | 1.05M. Bowfa &amp; Crystal $0.23 | 1.21M.\n<strong>Kraken:</strong> Ibans Staff [On Task] $0.08 | 421.05K. Trident+ [On Task] $0.12 | 631.58K (only On Task lines published).\n<strong>Giant Mole:</strong> With Falador Hard Diary $0.06 | 315.79K. Without Falador Hard Diary $0.80 | 4.21M (13 times more).\n<strong>Grotesque Guardians:</strong> Max Gear $0.20 | 1.05M. Average Gear $0.24 | 1.26M.\n<strong>Abyssal Sire:</strong> Max Gear $0.10 | 526.32K. Average Gear $0.12 | 631.58K.\n<strong>Skotizo:</strong> Max Gear $0.12 | 631.58K. Average Gear $0.16 | 842.11K.\n<strong>Phantom Muspah:</strong> Arclight $0.12 | 631.58K. No Arclight $0.18 | 947.37K.\n<strong>Phosanis Nightmare:</strong> Regular Solo $2.40 | 12.63M. (Decent Gear) $1.40 | 7.37M. (Max Gear) $1.10 | 5.79M.\n<strong>Moons of Peril:</strong> Max Gear $0.36 | 1.89M. 90+ Budget gear $0.48 | 2.53M.\n<strong>Araxxor:</strong> Zombie Axe &amp; Dragon Dagger – Each KC $0.40 | 2.11M. Dragon Scimitar &amp; Dragon Dagger – Each KC $0.50 | 2.63M.\n<strong>Desert Treasure II Bosses:</strong> Duke Sucellus $0.19 | 1M. The Whisperer $0.20 | 1.05M. Vardorvis $0.21 | 1.11M. The Leviathan $0.23 | 1.21M.",
