    "b_0617": "Barbarian Assault: Combat level below 75 +10%; Vale Totems: No log basket +10%; Mastering Mixology: Below 78 herb +20%; Warriors Guild: Below 95 combat +20%; Giants Foundry: Shopscape items +20%; Clue Scrolls: No STASH +20%; Player-owned house: No Grown Cat +$5.00; Herbiboar: No Stamina +30%, No herb sack +20%; Hunter rumours: Bank Furs +10%; Deep sea trawling: No offcuts +10% (Max boat Save 15% — discount); Slayer Points: No cannon +20%, Below 100 combat +30%; Golem Crafting: No fur +10%; Mahogany Homes: No house tabs/lunars +20%; Pest Control: Easy CAs done Save 10%, Med CAs done Save 20 (texto truncated in the page as «Save 20» — discount, no surcharge). Parsec +40% in minigames.",
