    "b_0629": "Calculated by me from the rates in §A1 (cheapest method per stretch). Totals BEFORE the calculator discount (3% typical, 5% in Sailing). «Lorax $ (server rate)» column at 1M = $0.19; «Lorax $ ($0.30)» column at the user's conversion, only to compare with the NDS totals (which use $0.30). TONS and Bald are «from» prices from their websites; NDS are totals calculated from gp/xp at $0.30/M.",
    "b_0630": "Change",
    "b_0631": "Capes &amp; Endgame:\n- Guaranteed Enhance + Infernal Cape: from $549.00, SAVE UP TO $200.00. Options: 80+ stats, no CoX or Titan prayers $849.00. 80+, Titan prayers $749.00. 80+, CoX prayers $699.00. 85+, no CoX or Titan $799.00. 85+, Titan $699.00. 85+, CoX $649.00. 90+, no Titan or CoX $699.00. 90+, Titan $599.00. 90+, CoX $549.00. Add-ons: Guarantee full Crystal Armour +$49.00. Add Dizana's Quiver +$59.00 (requires 80+ Magic and 80+ Ranged).\n- Max Cape From Scratch: $3,999.00 (was $7,499.00, SAVE $3,500.00; the client provides 1B GP in supplies). Add the Quest Cape +$249.00 (saves $100.00).\n- The Full Schebang: from $249.00, SAVE UP TO $140.00 — With megarares $249.00. No megarares $349.00 (Quiver + Infernal Cape + Blood Torva + Radiant Oathplate).\n- Blorva + Radiant Bundle: from $159.00, SAVE UP TO $70.00 — Max gear $159.00. Non-max gear $229.00.\n- Wilderness Completed: $799.00 (was $899.00, SAVE $100.00) — farm the Wilderness bosses until all 3 Voidwaker pieces drop.\nRaids &amp; Logs:\n- Megarare Trio: $8,499.00 (was $10,499.00, SAVE $2,000.00) — Twisted Bow + Tumeken's Shadow + Scythe of Vitur; assumes Bowfa, Ayak and Blade or Tent.\n- One Purple From Each Raid: $289.00 (was $349.00, SAVE $60.00).\n- Green Log Chambers of Xeric: $6,499.00, SAVE $2,000.00+ (does not include KC cape).\n- Green Log Theatre of Blood: $5,299.00, SAVE $2,500.00+ (Scythe included; does not include KC cape).\n- Every ToB Weapon: $4,899.00, SAVE $600.00+ (Scythe + Sanguinesti Staff + Ghrazi Rapier).\nIronman:\n- Ironman Early Game Bundle: $299.00 (was $539.00, SAVE $240.00) — Medium CA, Full Void, All Medium Diaries.\n- Early Iron Plug &amp; Play: $749.00 (was $839.00, SAVE $90.00) — Barrows Gloves + Song of the Elves; Black Mask reqs + guaranteed Black Mask +$59.00 (saves $100.00 vs separately).\n- Med Iron Ready: $394.00 (was $494.00, SAVE $100.00) — Full Moons of Peril collection log, 2 Guaranteed Tormented Synapses, 1 Guaranteed Zulrah unique; Both Royal Titans prayer scrolls (Mystic Vigour + Deadeye, normally $100.00) +$79.00.\n- Ironman Weapon &amp; Armour Bundle: $229.00 (was $304.00, SAVE $75.00) — Guaranteed Zombie Axe, Barrows tank armour, 1 full Moons of Peril set; requires 80+ combat.\n- Entry Into the End Game: $357.00 (was $434.00, SAVE $77.00) — Guaranteed Noxious Halberd (normally $179, in bundle $149), Guaranteed Dragon Warhammer (normally $120, in bundle $99), Guaranteed Dragon Hunter Wand (normally $135, in bundle $109); Guaranteed Ranger Boots (Medium clues until they drop; normally $650.00, saves $150.00) +$499.00.\n- Zenyte Jewellery Bundle: $149.00 — all 4 Zenytes from Demonic Gorillas; Booster finds the slayer task / off task adds 20% +$30.00.\n- Express Mystic Chinning for Irons: $259.00 (10,000 chinchompas hunted + 9 sessions).\n- Ironman Secondary Bundle: $64.00 — 25 herb runs + 25 birdhouse runs, 1,000 ultracompost, 2,000 teleport tabs, 2,000 snape grass + 2,000 red spider eggs.\nSlayer &amp; Prep:\n- Slayer Points Bundle: from $129.00, SAVE UP TO $51.00 — 5,000 slayer points $129.00. 10,000 slayer points $249.00 (both assume 100+ combat).\n- Blood Shards x5: $99.00 (was $125.00, SAVE $26.00; requires 99 Thieving and access to Darkmeyer / Sins of the Father).\n- Bingo Prep Bundle: $399.00 (was $480.00, SAVE $81.00) — 5,000 slayer points, 2,000 GOTR pulls, 1,000 Wintertodt pulls, 1,000 Tempoross pulls.\nCompletionist &amp; Logs:\n- Champion Scroll Bundle: $399.00 — all 11 champion scrolls + all champions.\n- MTA Green Log: $130.00 (was $156.00, SAVE $26.00).\n- Tithe Farm Green Log: $35.00 (was $40.00, SAVE $5.00).",
    "b_0632": "Chambers of Xeric — Regular Solo $3.00/run, CM Solo $5.50/run (raids page; the index says CoX from $3.00); Theatre of Blood — Entry $4.00/run, Normal $3.80/run, Hard $5.40/run; Tombs of Amascut — 150 $2.00/run (unlocked Solar Cowl), 200 $2.50/run (Sunlit Bracers), 300 $3.50/run (Siren's Staff), 350 (Ava Kit) $4.50/run, 425 (Ward Kit) $7.00/run, 450 (Pet Transmog) $25.00/run, 500 (Fang Kit) $45.00/run; The Fractured Archive — Login $14.00/run, Carry $20.00/run; 10 runs $30.00 (CoX Regular Solo), 25 runs with 5% discount in CoX/ToB/ToA and 35% in TFA. PvM coaching: $19.95/60 min.",
    "b_0633": "Charter Ship (!im charter) — per item",
    "b_0634": "Chompy Kill Upcharge ➜ +$0.0165/kill — <strong>anomaly: Hard ($4.00) costs more than Elite ($3.50)</strong>",
    "b_0635": "Commands <code>!s attack 40-80</code> and <code>!s defence 40-80</code>, run in the Calculator channel on 19/11/26. The bot gave no option or differentiated F2P price, only prices via Crypto / via Non-Crypto, and the methods it lists are members' (Sand Crabs, Gemstone Crabs, NMZ). 1.95M XP per skill. First value via Crypto, second via Non-Crypto.",
    "b_0636": "Combat Achievement Bundle: $50.00 fixed for the 8 tasks (Maggot Squasher Hard. Trying to Fit In Elite. Digging In Master. Cordoned Off Master. Maggot King Speed Chaser Master. Camping the King Master. King-Sized Clobbering Master. Perfect Maggot King). Max gear (ZCB + Scythe). Parsec +50%.",
    "b_0637": "Combat Achievements (web task by task vs Discord menus §A5–A7): Perfect Akkha web $18.00 vs Discord $11.00; Perfect Wardens web $26.00 vs Discord $20.00 (Perfect Warden); Perfect Zebak web $5.00 vs Discord $4.00 (in «Perfect Baba / Kephri / Zebak $4 each»); Amascut's Remnant web $50.00 vs Discord $45.00; Rockin' around the croc web $8.00 vs Discord $10.00; The Worst Ranged Weapon web $15.00 vs Discord $7.50 («Worst Ranged Weapon»); Commander Showdown web $1.00 vs Discord $4.00 («Commander»); I was here first! web $3.00 vs Discord $1.00. Colosseum: on Discord the CAs are surcharges on a Quiver (One-off / I Brought Mine Too / Showboating / Speed-Runner = Quiver +$5; Reinforcements +$15; Perfect Footwork / Slow Dancing +$10); on the web they are standalone individual prices (One-off $50.00, I Brought Mine Too $50.00, Showboating $50.00, Colosseum Speed-Runner $50.00, Reinforcements $60.00, Perfect Footwork $55.00, Slow Dancing $55.00). Match: Insanity $40, Morytania Only $42, Perfect Theatre $90, Harder Mode I/II/III $30/$36/$36, Perfect Olm Solo $17 / Trio $24, Feather Hunter $45, Peach Conjurer $40, Ash Collector $20, Perfect Nex $10, Nex Duo $10, Inferno Speed-Runner $55, Budget Setup $70, The Floor Is Lava $70, Wasn't Even Close $70, Nibbler Chaser $70, Playing with Jads $55, Gauntlet Speed-Runner $16, CG Speed-Runner $17, Egniol Diet $5 / II $5.50, Defence Doesn't Matter $3.50 / II $8.00.",
    "b_0638": "1-99 comparison (cheapest method per server): Elite $293,27 (Myth Cape Racks) vs Lorax $78,46, NDS $143,81, TONS $188,78 and Bald $100,94 — Elite is by far the most expensive in Construction. For 87→99: Elite $203,90 vs Lorax $54,37, NDS $67,97, Bald ~$70,18 and TONS ~$131,25.",
    "b_0639": "Competitors with Kings (USD)",
