    "b_0643": "Lookups from 2026-11-13 (Venator Bow, Toxic Blowpipe) and 2026-11-14 (moonlight moths, guaranteed DWH on ironman), in the Compare Prices chat. Same method: if Machines does not list the item, proposed = median of the competitors; if it lists it, proposed = midpoint between Machines and the median.",
    "b_0644": "Live lookups 2026-11-16 (Compare Prices chat). Hunting service / per-KC prices, not GE prices.",
    "b_0645": "Live lookups 2026-11-18 (Compare Prices chat), both on an ironman account. No server charges a separate ironman surcharge on guaranteed drops: the listed price is the price.",
    "b_0646": "Corporeal Beast $1.79 (1 option).",
    "b_0647": "Reputation costs: Colossal Blade 5000, Double Ammo Mould 2000, Kovac's Grog 300, Ore Pack 200, Smith Boots 3500, Smithing Catalyst 15, Smith Gloves 3500, Smith Trousers 4000, Smith's Tunic 4000; Using Metal Items? +5%.",
    "b_0648": "Crystal Shield Tier 2 $5.00. Tier 3 $10.00. Crystal Bow $10.00. No Tier 2 Bow $5.00. Tier 3 Bow $10.00 (fixed comparator prices, with base 70). Guaranteed enhanced seed: $500–$750 (in the calculator the total appeared as «Quote»; in the comparison table $500–$750). Guaranteed crystal armour: +$50.",
    "b_0649": "Covered exhaustively: quests (full Quest Log, 213 entries counting RfD subquests), diaries (12 regions × 4 tiers), skilling 1–99 (full table, except Fishing and Hitpoints, which are by quote), bosses (48 bosses, with «from» and gear options verified in the cases broken down above), Fire Cape, Corrupted Gauntlet (full matrix), Raids (CoX, ToB, ToA and TFA/Raids 4 with matrices), Nex, Guaranteed Drops (main catalogue), Accounts (2 in stock), Account Builds, Infernal Cape, Quiver, Blood Torva, Radiant Oathplate and Combat Achievements (bundles). <strong>UPDATE 9-11-2026: the task-by-task CA list and the Doom of Mokhaiotl, Yama, Maggot King, Megascale, Minigames, Ironman Gathering, Miscellaneous, Boss Pets, Pete Kayer, Hardcore Worlds, Service Bundles, Bald+ and Prime pages were covered on a second visit — see section F.</strong> Still not covered in detail: the gear breakdown of some of the bosses on the bosses page (only «from» and no. of options); the exact price of the guaranteed CG seed in the calculator (it appeared as «Quote», range $500–$750 in the table); and the ~318 remaining CA tasks in the «Misc» group (see §F15).",
    "b_0650": "Courses: (1-20) Gnome Stronghold, (21-43) Draynor Village, (44-54) Seers' Village, (54-77) Agility Pyramid, (77-91) Pollnivneach, (91-99) Ardougne, (95-99) Prifddinas, (96-99) Al-Kharid Rooftops, (10-99 AFK) Hallowed Sepulchre, (20-99 AFK) Brimhaven Agility, (30-99 AFK) Werewolf Agility Course, (40-99 AFK) Wilderness Agility Course, (75-83) Prifddinas Agility Course, (77-91) Hallowed Sepulchre (Floor 5), (85-99) Prifddinas Agility Course.",
