    "b_0663": "Deep Delve (Wave 8+): $1.70 each; 50+ runs: 30% off.",
    "b_0664": "Delve / Doom of Mokhaiotl (incl. Delve CAs and $155 bundle), Radiant Oathplate (incl. Recolour Bundle and acquisitions), Blood Torva, COX Megascales (100% Purple, scroll protections, Mystic Chinning), Account Builds (Iron and Main packages, SOTE, Quest Cape, Thralls, Spec XFer Alt), Ironman Gathering (implings, birdhouse, sandmining, cannonballs, herbiboar, karambwans, sharks, anglerfish, ecu keys, dragon bones, chinchompas, planks, glass, ores, agility pyramid, fungus, berries, scales, sceptre, wines, spider eggs, snape grass, sunfire splinters), Yama CA Bundle and Yama kills (bot), Sailing (new skill, bot), Guaranteed Drops and Raids 4 / The Fractured Archive (web only), pre-trained account purchases (web only), Fire Cape and Corrupted Gauntlet (web only), Bald+ / Prime.",
    "b_0665": "Delve / Doom: Discord «Delve CA Bundle $155» vs web «Delve (8 tasks) $100». Discord «Play Through $20» vs web Deep Delve $1.70 each (Wave 8+), Level 1–8 $4.25 each (different units: per run vs per floor).",
    "b_0666": "Delve CA Bundle - All Delve CAs $155. Yama CA Bundle: minus KC + Contract $95; minus KC + No Contract $55. Zuk CA Bundles: Jad Skip + Speed $105. Speed+Nibblers+Jad Skip+Budget $225. Speed+Nibblers+Jad Skip $165. All tasks inc KC $315. Quiver CA Bundles: Bulk KC = $35 / 215m (as published, ambiguous unit). Brought mine too + Slow dancing + Speed = $65. Speed CA free with any max gear Quiver. TOA Bundle: ALL PERFECTIONS $45. ALL TOA EXPERT Exc Speed $305. Inc Speed $355. Gauntlet Bundle - ALL CAs MINUS KC $80. DT2 Bundle - ALL CAs MINUS KC $185 (save $25). Godwars - ALL GWD CAs ex KC $205. COX Bundles: Full Leech $18.50 (49 CA points). Participation $25 (65 CA points). All Speeds (Participation) $105. All Speeds (Login) $125. TOB Bundle: Minimal participation $14 (31 CA points). Participation $18 (48 CA points). All Speeds Participation $120. Login $135. All HMT Speeds: Participation $100. Login $110. «Prices assume max gear. Parsec +30%».",
    "b_0667": "Desert Treasure 2 (from $15.00, ~4 h): No Brews +$2.00 (+5 min), No Xeric's talisman +$2.00 (+5 min), Below 94 Mage +$2.00 (+5 min), No Staminas +20% (+10% time), Parsec +40%; Dragon Slayer 2 (from $10.00, ~3 h): No Brews +$3.00 (+5 min), Below 80 Range +$4.00 (+10 min), No Goutweed +$1.00 (+10 min), Ancient Cavern access +$2.00 (+20 min), No Staminas +20% (+10% time), Parsec +40%; Desert Treasure 1 (from $6.00, ~1.5 h): Below 43 Prayer +$10.00 (+60 min), No Staminas +20%, Parsec +40%; The Blood Moon Rises (from $30.00, ~3 h): Below 85 Combat +$5.00 (+5 min), No Staminas +20% (+10% time), Parsec +40%; Dream Mentor: No goutweed +$1.00 (+10 min); Secrets of the North: Below 100 Combat +$3.00 (+5 min), No Icy basalt +$2.00 (+10 min); RFD - Freeing King Awowogei (from $1.80, ~1 h): No Gorilla/Ninja/Zombie monkey greegree +$2.00 (+20 min), No Staminas +20%, Parsec +40%; Mudfoot's Big Adventure and The Writing's on the Wall: No Staminas +20%, Parsec +40%. On the site, many quests show «1–4 options» without detailing the amount in the list (the amount appears when adding/selecting); only the above ones were verified in detail.",
    "b_0668": "Extended breakdown:\n- Barbarian Assault: Full fighter torso (normal) $22.50 (leech $11.25). Torso (leech) $25.00 (average of orders, your task may vary). 200 attack XP $6.80. 200 strength XP $6.80. 200 defence XP $6.80. 200 range XP $6.80. 200 magic XP $6.80. 200 prayer XP $6.80. Granite body $7.00. BA level 5 (All Roles) $95.00. Attack $40. Attack (leech) $20. Strength $40. Strength (leech) $25. Defence $40. Defence (leech) $25. Range $40. Range (leech) $25. Mage $40. Mage (leech) $25. Healer $60. Healer (leech) $50 (the page counter says 18 options; 22 lines are listed).\n- Clues (per clue): Beginner $1.20. Easy $0.24. Medium $0.17. Hard $0.19. Elite $0.40. Says $0.34. Master $0.54. Armadyl $5. Bandos $5 (the page says 10 options; 9 price lines are listed).\n- Mage Training Arena: MTA Green Log $130.00. Full infinity set $65. Infinity top $21.30. Juggling $9.18 (no clear unit on the page). Mage's book $27.50. Alchemy $9.18. Telekinetic $9.18. Graveyard $9.18. Enchantment $9.18. Bonus $15 (the page says 9 options).\n- Mastering Mixology: 1 to 100 $548.53. 1 to 90 $252.90. 1 to 70 $69.55. 1 to 55 $26.85. 1 to 35 $2.20. Single order (3 runs) $3.50. Alchemy $9.18.\n- Last Man Standing: 25 kills $18.00. 100 kills $72.00. 500 kills $282.00. 1,000 kills $360.00. 2,000 kills $600.00. 5,000 kills $1,500.00 (100+ kill streak).\n- Giants Foundry (per commission): Ali legs $15. Ali sword $15. Ali shield $15. Ali helmet $15. Ali armour $15. Ali gloves $15 (each «$15 EACH»?) — on the page each piece appears at $0.25 with a $0.25 total; the base «from $0.25» price is for the basic commission and the Alien pieces are listed at $15 each.\n- Tithe Farm: 1 to 80 $72.00. 1 to 100 $106.90. 1 to 54 $13.03. 1 to 74 $46.10. 1 to 34 $2.89.",
    "b_0669": "Extended breakdown:\n- Farming runs (per run): Herb run – 6 Patches $0.80. Allotment run $1.20. Herb + Allotment $1.80. Seaweed run $0.41. Herb run – 10 patches $1.20. Herb Run – 8 Patches $1.00.\n- Mining: Sandmining w/ humidify / circlet $1.00 per 1k. Sandmining w/o humidify / circlet $1.10 per 1k. Amethyst Ore w/ Expert Gloves $15.00 per 1k. Amethyst Ore w/o Expert Gloves $30.00 per 1k. Bone Shards – Calcium Rocks $1.30 per 1k.\n- Red chinchompas (per 1,000): 63+ Hunter $9.00. 75+ Hunter $8.00. 83+ Hunter $7.00.\n- Pharaoh's sceptre: 51–60 Thieving $28.00. 61–70 $25.50. 71–80 $24.00. 81–90 $19.55. 91+ $18.00.\nPage note: many supplies are cheaper with the right diary or level.",
