    "b_0686": "Published calculator example: «!q agb,btwcb,bys» (as written).",
    "b_0687": "The bot uses the command «!s <skill> <start>-<end>» (e.g. «!s sailing 5-40») and replies with XP per method, total $ and total M, and a Discount %. Five historical calculations from the channel match EXACTLY with GP per XP at $0.19/M: Sailing 5-40 (Port Tasks 17.859 XP + Barracuda Trials 18.977 XP) $8.59 | 45.206M, Discount 5,0%; Fishing 84-99 (Barb Fishing 10.083.058 XP × 42.11) $78.24 | 411.813M, Discount 3,0%; Runecrafting 77-99 (GOTR 11.558.850 XP × 105.26) $224.24 | 1.18B, Discount 3,0%; Construction 70-99 (Mahogany Tables 12.296.804 XP × 31.58) $71.57 | 376.671M, Discount 3,0%; Farming 81-99 (Tithe Farm 10.841.613 XP × 52.63) $105.16 | 553.493M, Discount 3,0%. Conclusion: skill prices, published as a number / XP, are GP per XP; total $ = GP / 1.000.000 × $0.19, minus the calculator discount (3% in 4 of 5 examples, 5% in Sailing). NO new command was sent in the channel: the task is read-only and the history already verifies the unit exactly. Note: the channel also shows «Invalid skill name: range» (the correct name is «ranged»).",
    "b_0688": "The \"Sythe Vouches\" button in the channel links to https://www.sythe.org/threads/kings-boosting-vouches/ (thread \"Kings Boosting Vouches\", also kings-boosting-vouches.4379509). After passing the Cloudflare check, <strong>the thread was read in full (messages #1–#70, 24 Nov 2025–30 Aug 2026): it is a vouches thread and does NOT contain a price list</strong>. Only amounts: #14 (Tyler990): \"another service charged me 120$ … these guys did it for 40$ less\" → $80 implied, service unnamed; #66 (Robim): \"Over $2000 spent with kings boosting\"; #69 (Scoog): \"over $1300 worth of services from them on my HCIM\". The rest of the \"$\" are donor badges ($300+ Donor, $200 USD Donor, $5 USD Donor). Services mentioned without a price: quests, skilling (70-75 Attack, 99 RC on ironman), BA Level 5 All, CoX purple, ToB, Infernal Cape / Dizana's Quiver (signature: \"Get Infernal or Quiver – if not done in 24 hours, you get it for free!\"), GP buying/selling (volumes 100m, 250m, 657m, 740m, 1b, 1.7b, 2b, 6.5B+, no rate per million or USD price).",
    "b_0689": "The public #🧮︱calculator log (5–9 Nov 2026) matches these rates in every case checked (Agility, Thieving, Fishing, Slayer, Magic, Mining, Runecrafting, Woodcutting, Cooking, Firemaking).",
    "b_0690": "Elite Services — Prices (server 5 of 10)",
    "b_0691": "Elite does not publish a skills list. The server's only per-XP prices are in Ironman Gathering (§A5, Construction) and some per-point/per-item prices in minigames (§A4). No 1-99 totals can be calculated except for Construction (§A1b). Prayer, Herblore and other skills: no price published.",
    "b_0692": "Elves Pickpocket (ELVES tab, !misc elves)",
    "b_0693": "On CoX/ToB/ToA the page asks you to tick what the account does NOT have (loadout: gear, teleports, etc.) and warns that lower gear/stats can change the price, but the amount of that adjustment is not shown in the list; Parsec +40% (CoX/ToB/ToA) and +60% (TFA). Combat achievements: «Prices assume max gear and stats. Lower stats or gear can make some tasks impossible, or change the price» — without % published.",
    "b_0694": "Discord shows no explicit upfront payment or minimum; on the website, payment by card or crypto at checkout, automatic ticket, full-refund guarantee if it cannot be completed and partial refund for what was not delivered; bulk KC up to 40% off (Quiver/Colosseum); bundles with stated savings ($10/$20/$30 on Zuk, $25 on DT2) that contradict the Bundles menu prices (see §D.1); non-crypto GP +15%, only 100+ cb accounts, no F2P or sub-100 cb.",
    "b_0695": "In the skills tabs, there is generally <strong>no fixed price per level range</strong>: each method points to the calculator with «Example: Type !s skillname 1-99 in Calculator Channel». The 💰 buttons on the skills tabs are decorative.",
    "b_0696": "Bot typos kept as-is: \"W/O Falador Hard Dairy\", \"W/ Desert Elite Diray\", \"Alcleanical Hydra\".",
    "b_0697": "Status: 23 !s complete + 13 !b complete. Pending then: 14 !b and 26 !m — resolved later from the history, see addendum continued below; only !b final, exact !m brim 100 and exact !m nmz 1 were left with no price. Commands invalid according to the bot (no price, \"Invalid bossname entered!\"): !b cgp100, !b cgnp100, !b duke100, !b cox5, !b mega5, !b tobn5.",
