    "b_0849": "PvM: the PvM page publishes higher «from» prices than the services index for the same bosses (Zulrah $0.22 vs $0.18; Vorkath $0.22 vs $0.18; Doom $3.10 vs $2.50; Yama $0.75 vs $0.60; Moons $0.75 vs $0.60; Muspah $0.30 vs $0.25; Demonic Gorilla $0.12 vs $0.10; Corrupted Gauntlet $0.90 vs $0.75); also, the Zulrah detail shows Tbow/Shadow at $0.18/kill, below the PvM list's «from $0.22».",
    "b_0850": "Quest Cape Pack (!bun qpcape5, tab titled QUEST POINTS CAPE)",
    "b_0851": "Quest Cape in bundles (Account Builds, web): Main $449.00; Ironman $1,099.00.",
    "b_0852": "Quest Speedrunning: Quest speedrun outfit $48.00 each.",
    "b_0853": "Quests (only !q), Diaries (only !m), Skilling (only bot/web/ticket), Hallowed Sepulchre (only !m hs), PvM Slayer/GWD/Wilderness/Misc (only !b per boss), Ironman no max gear, Radiant/Blood Torva/Quiver/Infernal without max gear, Raid CAs not listed, «Any CAs not seen», «Individual CAs - Ask for a Quote», Delve shop options (confirm via ticket), «Others bundled enquire». No Fire Cape, Corrupted Gauntlet, Raids 4, Guaranteed Drops or account prices on Discord; only on bald.gg with no fixed figure on the homepage except the «from» prices quoted.",
    "b_0854": "Quiver: the page says from $50.00, but a related card on the Blood Torva page says «from $54 flat».",
    "b_0855": "Radiant Oathplate $65; Contract of Forfeit Breath $13; Glyphic Attenuation $13; Sensory Clouding $20 — with the line \"Without Scorching Bow +$5\" after it; Divine Severance $18; Bloodied Blows $18; Oathplate Acquisition $95; Familiar Acquisition $6.",
