    "b_0861": "Surcharges: Ranged &lt;90 +$10; Magic &lt;94 +$10; Without Rigour +$5; Without Blowpipe +$10; Parsec +30%.",
    "b_0862": "Surcharges: W/ Titan Prayers +5%; W/ Standard Prayers +10%; Parsec +50%. KC discounts: 50+ KC 2% Off; 100+ KC 4% Off; 200+ KC 6% Off; 400+ KC 8% Off; 500+ KC 10% Off.",
    "b_0863": "Refer friends and earn rewards.",
    "b_0864": "Reference per KC: the hilt drops 1/512, so the expected cost per KC is about $128 at Machines' Bowfa rate (512 × $0.25). Bald's guaranteed ($100) comes out cheaper than the expected cost per KC — it is the better offer of the two.",
    "b_0865": "Reference: the synapse drops 1/200, so at Kings' low rate the expected cost per KC is about $42 (200 × $0.21) versus $70 guaranteed — guaranteed comes out more expensive on average but with no risk of a dry streak.",
