    "b_0876": "Reward unlocks: Log Basket $12.00 each. Jeweller's Chisel $20.00. Imbue Scroll $5.00. Plank Sack $20.00 (Teak planks +15%. Under 70 Construction +25%). Fletching Knife $25.00. Amy's Saw $30.00 (Teak planks +15%. Under 70 Construction +25%). Expert Mining Gloves $40.00.",
    "b_0877": "Pace: about 250–350 per hour normally with box traps (80+, 5 traps), about 500–600 per hour with 3-tick. For 30,000: about <strong>100 hours</strong> normally, about <strong>60 hours</strong> with 3-tick.",
