    "b_0889": "Skills 23/23, Quests (Free 23, A–M, M–T, T–Z 40, Mini Quests 26, full Diaries), Minigames 25/25, Ironman 14/14, Combat Tasks 18/18, Accounts 15/15, Miscellaneous 16/16, Pet Boosting 10 bosses, Crystalline Hunllef 2/2, Firecape 2/2, Infernal Cape 3/3, Dizanas Quiver 3/3, DT2 Bosses 3/3, Raids via Login 4/4, Pvm 13/13. No requested section was left pending.",
