    "b_0891": "Smelting (!im smith1000) — per bar",
    "b_0892": "Smithing bars: No Coal bag +50%, No Stamina +20%; Buying ores: No stamina +20%; Golem: No fur +10%; Master Farmer: No seedbox +10%; Elf &amp; Vyre: No Shadow Veil +15%, No Dodgy necklaces +15%, No hard Ardougne Diary +10%; Karambwans: No Fish Barrel +30%; Anglerfish: No Fish Barrel +15%; Amethyst: No Expert gloves +25%. Parsec +40% on the full order.",
    "b_0893": "Only 10 pets have a fixed starting price (starting price, maxed gear); the rest are «Custom Price — QUOTED IN LIVE CHAT»:\nWith a fixed price: Baby Mole (Giant Mole, 1/3,000) $340.00. Kalphite Princess (Kalphite Queen, 1/3,000) $673.00 with Diary / $950.00 without Diary. Dark Core (Corporeal Beast, 1/5,000) $2,100.00 Main / $6,500.00 Ironman. General Graardor (1/5,000) $1,530.00. K'ril Tsutsaroth (1/5,000) $1,632.00. Kree'arra (1/5,000) $2,650.00. Zilyana (1/5,000) $1,634.00. Tiny Tempor (Tempoross, 1/8,000) $440.00. TzRek-Jad (TzHaar Fight Cave, 1/200 per kill or gamble, 1/100 on Slayer task) $850.00. Vorki (Vorkath, 1/3,000) $734.00.\nWith a custom price (live chat, drop rate in parentheses): Abyssal Orphan (Sire, 1/2,560). Baron (Duke, 1/2,500). Butch (Vardorvis, 1/3,000). Callisto Cub (1/1,500 Callisto / 1/2,800 Artio). Dom (Doom, 1/250–1/1,000). Gull (Shellbane Gryphon, 1/3,000). Hellpuppy (Cerberus, 1/3,000). Huberte (Hueycoatl, 1/400). Ikkle Hydra (1/3,000). Jal-nib-rek (Inferno, 1/100 per kill or gamble, 1/75 on Slayer task). Lil' Zik (ToB, 1/650 Normal / 1/500 Hard). Lil'viathan (Leviathan, 1/2,500). Moxi (Amoxliatl, 1/3,000). Muphin (Muspah, 1/2,500). Nexling (Nex, 1/500). Noon (Grotesque Guardians, 1/3,000). Olmlet (CoX, 1/53). Chaos Elemental (1/300 Elemental / 1/1,000 Fanatic). Dagannoth Prime / Rex / Supreme (each 1/5,000). Kraken (1/3,000). Smoke Devil (Thermy, 1/3,000). Snakeling (Zulrah, 1/4,000). Phoenix (Wintertodt, 1/5,000). Prince Black Dragon (KBD, 1/3,000). Scorpia's Offspring (1/2,015.75). Scurry (Scurrius, 1/3,000). Skotos (Skotizo, 1/65). Smolcano (Zalcano, 1/2,250). Smol Heredit (Sol Heredit, 1/200). Sraracha (Sarachnis, 1/3,000). Tumeken's Guardian (ToA, varies). Venenatis Spiderling (1/1,500 Venenatis / 1/2,800 Spindel). Vet'ion Jr. (1/1,500 Vet'ion / 1/2,800 Calvar'ion). Wisp (Whisperer, 1/2,000). Yami (Yama, 1/2,500 / 1/100 Contract of familiar acquisition). Youngllef (Gauntlet, 1/2,000 normal / 1/800 Corrupted).",
    "b_0894": "Only 2 accounts in stock at the time of the visit:",
    "b_0895": "Only 2 of the 7 servers publish these guaranteed drops. Verified live at bald.gg/services/maggot-king on 2026-11-14 at 18:39 UTC: \"Guaranteed drop Crimson kisten from $249\" and \"Guaranteed drop Elder venator fang from $164\" (\"from\" prices, by gear tier; they can go up if gear is missing). Kings: Kisten $490.00, Fang $365.00 (fixed). Machines, TONS, NDS, Lorax and Elite do not list them as guaranteed — Machines only sells Maggot King per KC ($0.70 max gear).",
    "b_0896": "Only Machines publishes a price: \"Moonlight Moth Mix\" <strong>$0.07 each</strong> (Ironman Misc gathering, Full Gather) → <strong>1000 × $0.07 = $70.00</strong>. No other server of the 6 lists it, so there is no median or intermediate to calculate; if the client wants only the moths in jars and nothing else, it would be a per-ticket quote. Note from the user (2026-11-14): they can be charged 70–80 EUR full price — about $81–$92 at her rate of ~1.155 EUR→USD, above the $70 list price.",
