    "b_0909": "Third visit to bald.gg (9-11-2026, 05:18–05:19 Caracas), same rule: only public browsing and calculators, no checkout, account, ticket or personal data. The list loaded in full (622 tasks, no pagination). The page's own tier filters give the exact count: Easy 38, Medium 58, Hard 84, Elite 161, Master 159, Grandmaster 122 = 622, which matches the page total. Prices with Max Gear; Parsec +30%. Tasks start at $0.25. This section breaks down the «Misc» tasks that were missing; the raids/GWD/DT2/Nightmare/Yama/Doom/Nex/Zulrah/Vorkath/Inferno/Colosseum/Gauntlet ones were already in §F1 and are not repeated here (except in the tier counts).",
    "b_0910": "Tickets $0.14 each.",
    "b_0911": "All prices include the 30% Hardcore surcharge; refunded if the character dies during the job. Parsec +30% (Login / Parsec selector). Quest surcharges: no stamina potions but with Graceful +15% on quest fees. No stamina potions and no Graceful +25% on quest fees (or +15% if Full Graceful is in the plan). Gather my quest items +20% on quest fees.\nStarting plans: A better first week $79.96 (9 starter quests with levels, fairy rings, Ardougne easy diary, 43 Prayer, Full Graceful). Barrows gloves route: full build $93.60, or Recipe for Disaster solo from $12.60. Prifddinas: Song of the Elves from $11.49 (full elf chain, 8 skills to 70, or all together).\nMoney making: Eclipse red wine $6.50 per 250 bottles (~175,000 GP; 500 bottles $13.00. 1,000 bottles $26.00). Agility Pyramid $13.00 per 100 laps with 75+ Agility (~1,000,000 GP). $19.50 per 100 laps below 75 Agility.\nList of 31 services (from, with the 30% Hardcore already included): Full Graceful $52.00. Agility milestones from $1.82 (25/30/50/60/70). Starter quest bundle from $15.87. Early combat quest route from $6.19. Fairy rings unlock from $2.86. Animal Magnetism from $1.55. Barrows gloves from $12.60. Song of the Elves from $11.49. Prayer levels from $0.43. Piety quest requirements from $2.21. Ardougne easy diary from $2.21. Useful diary bundles from $2.21. Dragon defender $15.60. Fighter torso from $32.05. Magic and teleport levels from $0.91. Construction milestones from $2.39. Farming and herb runs from $0.53. Crafting and Herblore from $0.18. Mining, Smithing and Woodcutting from $1.05. Thieving milestones from $2.21. Hunter progression from $1.77. Fossil Island and birdhouses from $0.52. Early Slayer levels from $40.43. Agility Pyramid from $13.00. Sunfire splinter gathering from $1.30 per 1,000. Red chinchompas from $9.10 per 1,000. Gathering and materials from $1.30 per 1,000. Fishing, food and Cooking from $2.60. Bank organisation $15.60. Add individual quests from $0.66. Eclipse red money making from $1.33 (in the money making section: $6.50 per 250 bottles).",
