    "b_0913": "Guaranteed Toxic Blowpipe",
    "b_0914": "After stopping publishing, read-only search in the server history (Calculator and, when the price was only there, ticket-handlers-notepad or other channels). Prices as shown by the bot, with the date and the user who ran each command; the discount varies by user and date, so the totals include that discount and the price per kill/unit is the comparable figure. First value via Crypto, second via Non-Crypto. Before the stop order, Luna published 2 more commands (!b toasolo100 and !b doom100, both invalid); Ali replied the same day with \"!b toas 100\".",
    "b_0915": "Varies by service and is NOT uniform: +40% on the full order on most pages (Quests, Skilling, Minigames, Ironman, Diaries —per each page's toggle—, PvM, CA, CoX/ToB/ToA); The Fractured Archive +60%; Fire Cape +50%; Blood Torva +30% (+$27.00 on the $90.00 pack); Yama Contracts +30%; Infernal Cape +$12.00 flat; Dizana's Quiver +$10.00 flat. (On the Infernal page, Parsec shows as +$12 on $55; on Fire Cape as +50%.)",
    "b_0916": "Guaranteed Venator Bow",
    "b_0917": "Exact checks: the 10 Recipe for Disaster sub-quests add up to $13.90, the same as the full quest; the Infinity pieces add up to $63.00, the same as Full Infinity.",
