    "b_0924": "Zulrah ×100, Nox Hally: from $20.00, $0.20/kill at the best price, ~5 h; levels (lowest Atk/Str): 95+ without surcharge, 90+ +$0.04/kill, 85+ +$0.08/kill, 80+ +$0.15/kill; No antivenoms +$0.02/kill, No ring of suffering +$0.02/kill, Below 76 Agility +$0.06/kill; volume: 150+ −5%, 300+ −10%. Royal Titans ×100: from $28.50, $0.285/kill at the best price; levels: 90+ without surcharge, 80+ +$0.10/kill, 70+ +$0.25/kill; melee weapon Scythe/SRA/Saeldor without surcharge, Full bloodmoon +$0.10/kill, Worse +$0.25/kill; ranged Blowpipe/Bowfa without surcharge, Full eclipse +$0.10/kill, Worse +$0.25/kill; volume: 50+ −5%, 150+ −10%. Lizardman Shamans ×1000: from $45.00, $0.045/kill at the best price; Ranged 90+ without surcharge, 80+ +$0.02/kill, 70+ +$0.04/kill; Bowfa/blowpipe without surcharge, RCB/MSB +$0.04/kill; No cannon +$0.015/kill; volume: 500+ −5%, 1000+ −10%. On the web, the price per kill varies with the gear (e.g. Zulrah: Tbow/Shadow $0.18, Bowfa $0.24, Blowpipe+Trident $0.28, RCB+Fire $1.00, Nox Hally $0.20 — inferior gear costs more per kill).",
