    "b_0021": "(Todos los precios asumen al menos 1 wilderness weapon — flail/staff/craws; asumen max salvo indicación contraria; recargos por equipo/stats que falten.) <strong>Artio</strong> (las CAs se etiquetan «Callisto»): 1m — Craws/Webweaver ($0.30); 1.2m — Bowfa+crystal ($0.36). CAs: Callisto Adept (10kc) — KC Task; Callisto Veteran (20kc) — KC Task. <strong>Chaos Elemental:</strong> 600k — Wildy Weapons ($0.18); 750k+ — No wildy weapon ($0.23+). CAs: Chaos Elemental Adept (10kc) — KC Task; Hoarder 5m ($1.50); The Flincher 15m ($4.50); Chaos Elemental Veteran (20kc) — KC Task. <strong>Calvar'ion (Vet'ion):</strong> 1.00m — Vigorra/Ursine chainmace ($0.30); 1.25m — Bludgeon ($0.38); 1.35m — Cudgel/Zombie axe ($0.41). CAs: Vet'ion Adept (10kc) — KC Task; Vet'eran (20kc) [sic] — KC Task. <strong>Scorpia:</strong> 500k — Accursed Sceptre w/ freezes ($0.15); 600k — Trident w/ freezes ($0.18); 750k — ibans + snares (no trident) ($0.23). CAs: Scorpia Adept (10kc) — KC Task; I Can't Reach That 5m ($1.50); Guardians No More 5m ($1.50); Scorpia Veteran (20kc) — KC Task. <strong>Spindel (Venenatis):</strong> 1.00m — Vigorra/Ursine Chainmace ($0.30); 1.25m — Bludgeon ($0.38); 1.35m — Cudgel/Zombie axe ($0.41). CAs: Venenatis Adept (10kc) — KC Task; Venenatis Veteran (20kc) — KC Task. <strong>Chaos Fanatic &amp; Crazy Archaeologist:</strong> 400k — 1kc ($0.12). Chaos Fanatic CAs: Chaos Fanatic Adept (25kc) — KC Task; Praying to the Gods 15m ($4.50). Crazy Archaeologist CAs: Crazy Archaeologist Adept (25kc) — KC Task.",
