    "b_0113": "<strong>CoX &amp; CM KC</strong> (max gear; el precio se ve afectado por equipo inferior; recargos por cada objeto que falte, incluidos dwh, dhl, tbow, bp, trident, salve ei; el cliente conserva todo el loot): Solo CoX Login 15m/kc ($4.50), 50+ kc 5% de descuento; Team CoX Challenge Mode 18m/kc ($5.40), 50+ kc 5%, equipo máximo de 5 personas, «great for kits/dust/pet»; Solo CoX Challenge Mode 25m/kc ($7.50), 50+ kc 5%.\n<strong>CoX CAs:</strong> Cry No More 5m ($1.50); Kill It with Fire 5m ($1.50); Shayzien Specialist 5m ($1.50); Together We'll Fall 15m ($4.50); Redemption Enthusiast 5m ($1.50); Mutta-diet 5m ($1.50); Perfectly Balanced 5m ($1.50); Undying Raid Team 25m ($7.50); Blizzard Dodger 5m ($1.50); Dancing with Statues 5m ($1.50); No Time for Death 5m ($1.50); Perfect Olm (Solo) 30m ($9.00); Perfect Olm (Trio) 80m ($24.00); Stop Drop and Roll 10m ($3.00); A Not So Special Lizard 40m ($12.00); CoX (5Man) Speed-Chaser 90m ($27.00); Putting It Olm on the Line 65m ($19.50); Playing with Lasers 5m ($1.50); Anvil No More 10m ($3.00); Blind Spot 5m ($1.50); CoX (5Man) Speed-Runner 125m ($37.50); CoX (Solo) Speed-Runner 50m ($15.00); CoX (Trio) Speed-Runner 90m ($27.00).\n<strong>CoX CM CAs:</strong> Dusk Seeker 25m ($7.50); Immortal Raider 35m ($10.50); Immortal Raid Team 35m ($10.50); CM Solo Speed-Runner sub 38:30 65M ($19.50); CM Trio sub 27:00 120M ($36.00); CM 5-Scale sub 25:00 175M ($52.50).",
    "b_0114": "<strong>CoX Megascales por tiers de protección de scroll</strong> (900M / 1.400M / 2.300M) con duración estimada de 3-4 horas por raid.",
    "b_0115": "<strong>CoX Megascales:</strong> 900m 100% no chins req ($270,00); 1400m 100% with single scroll protection ($420,00); 2300m 100% with double scroll ($690,00). Time Frame: Raids typically last anywhere from 3 to 4 hours on average. Requirements: 55 Farming Hard requirement, Correct Cooking Level for Fishing (60+ Cooking if 60 Fishing). No hay opciones de Megascale para ToB ni ToA en el desplegable (solo 4 opciones: Chambers, Theatre, Tombs, Cox Mega scale). No hay The Fractured Archive / raid 4 en el desplegable Raids.",
    "b_0116": "<strong>CoX Megascales</strong> (req. 55+ Farming, 60+ Fishing, 60+ Cooking; recargos: Without Fish Eater ➜ +2%; Login ➜ +10%; Parsec ➜ +30%): 100% Purple Chance – with Chins $110.00; 100% Purple Chance – without Chins $135.00; 100% Purple Chance + Single Scroll Protection $205.00; 100% Purple Chance + Double Scroll Protection $260.00.",
    "b_0117": "<strong>CoX Teaching y Boosting</strong> por separado (Teaching 2+1 $3.50, 3+1 $5.70; CM Teaching 2+1 $10.00; CM Full Leeching $9.00).",
    "b_0118": "<strong>CoX: Normal Mode</strong> (precios pueden variar por gear/stats): Solo Login – W/ Max Gear $3.50; Solo Login – W/ Bowfa + DHL $3.70; Solo Login – W/ Bowfa + Abyssal Tentacle $4.70; Leech $3.00.",
    "b_0119": "<strong>CoX:</strong> Discord Solo logins Normal Tbow+Shadow+Lance/Scythe $2.55/kc frente a web Normal Solo $2.80. Discord CM Solo $4/kc frente a web CM Solo $5.10.",
    "b_0120": "<strong>Colosseum CAs</strong> (idéntico en «Combat Achievements» &gt; Colloseum CAs): I was here first! $1. Denied $5. Furball $5. Sportsmanship - Quiver (sin recargo indicado). One-off - Quiver + $5. I Brought Mine Too - Quiver + $5. Showboating - Quiver + $5. Colosseum Speed-Runner - Quiver + $5. Reinforcements - Quiver + $15. Perfect Footwork - Quiver + $10. Slow Dancing - Quiver + $10. Parsec orders are subject to a 30% extra. All Colosseum CAs minus 10kc: Login $140 / Parsec $230. Including KC: Login $270 / Parsec $340. Individual CAs - Ask for a Quote. Bulk KC up to 40% off.",
    "b_0121": "<strong>Colosseum Grand Champion a 225m por login KC al comprar 2+ KC</strong> y Quiver por Login frente a Parsec.",
    "b_0122": "<strong>Combat Achievements por tramo</strong> (None→Easy 120m hasta Hard→Elite 1.100m; Master/Grandmaster por ticket).",
    "b_0123": "<strong>Combat Achievements:</strong> encabezado «Please open a ticket for a quote!»; None to Easy 120m ($36,00); Easy to Medium 240m ($72,00); Medium to Hard 480m ($144,00); Hard to Elite 1100m ($330,00); «this prices for max bank account + max states»; Master or Grandmaster: open ticket.",
    "b_0124": "<strong>Combat Achievements</strong> dice «Please open a ticket for a quote!» y a la vez publica los precios por tramo hasta Elite.",
