    "b_0150": "<strong>Descuentos por volumen:</strong> Dizana's Quiver 5x → 10% Off, 10x → 20% Off; Corrupted Gauntlet por KC 50+ 2% / 100+ 4% / 200+ 6% / 400+ 8% / 500+ 10%; Barbarian Assault High Gamble 50x 2.5% / 75x 5% / 100x 10%; Pet Boosting: KC gratis por volumen (ver §A11); Birdhouse Run 25+ a $0.28.",
    "b_0151": "<strong>Desert Treasure 2</strong> (por kill, Max gear): Leviathan kills $0.26. Vardorvis kills $0.24. Duke kills $0.20. Whisperer kills $0.29. «Upcharges are possible for changes in gear &amp; stats». Type !b dt2 en #calculation-bot.",
    "b_0152": "<strong>Diaries:</strong> SIN PRECIO; solo comandos !m: Ardougne !m ardougne, Desert !m desert, Falador !m falador, Fremennik !m fremennik, Kandarin !m kandarin, Karamja !m karamja, Kourend !m kourend, Lumbridge !m lumbridge, Morytania !m morytania, Varrock !m varrock, Western province !m wp, Wilderness !m wilderness.",
    "b_0153": "<strong>Diaries:</strong> varios tiers incluyen requisitos con coste aparte (Ardougne Elite: 800K NMZ Pts; Kandarin Elite: Lvl 5 All Role at BA $25; Karamja Medium: 25M for gout tuber; Kourend Elite: dark totem &amp; CoX kc; Lumbridge Hard: 55m for Bones to peaches; Western Provinces Elite con Chompy Kills $13.00 vs $5.00 sin ellos).",
