    "b_0162": "<strong>Easy — 38 tareas (todas nuevas).</strong>\nAberrant Spectre: Noxious Foe $1.00. Barrows: Barrows Novice $5.00. Defence? What Defence? $2.00. Black Dragon: Big, Black and Fiery $1.00. Bloodveld: The Demonic Punching Bag $1.00. Bryophyta: A Slow Death $2.00. Bryophyta Novice $1.00. Fighting as Intended II $0.50. Preparation Is Key $0.50. Protection from Moss $0.50. Deranged Archaeologist: Deranged Archaeologist Novice $4.25. Fire Giant: The Walking Volcano $1.00. Giant Mole: Giant Mole Novice $4.25. Greater Demon: A Greater Foe $1.00. Not So Great After All $1.00. Hellhound: A Demon's Best Friend $1.00. King Black Dragon: King Black Dragon Novice $5.00. Lizardman Shaman: A Scaley Encounter $1.00. Shayzien Protector $1.00. Hill/Moss/Fire Giant (Shayzien): Into the Den of Giants $1.00. Obor: Fighting as Intended $1.00. Obor Novice $1.00. Sleeping Giant $1.00. Royal Titans: Elemental Company $1.00. Let them fight $3.00. One by one $3.00. Sarachnis: Sarachnis Novice $6.00. Scurrius: Scurrius Novice $1.00. Sit Rat $1.50. Tempoross: Calm Before the Storm $0.25. Fire in the Hole! $0.25. Master of Buckets $0.25. Tempoross Novice $5.00. Wintertodt: Cosy $0.50. Handyman $0.25. Mummy! $0.25. Wintertodt Novice $5.00. Wyrm: A Slithery Encounter $1.00.",
