    "b_0207": "<strong>Gauntlet (normal + Corrupted) — 13 tareas.</strong>\nElite: Corrupted Gauntlet Veteran $8.00. Egniol Diet $5.00. Gauntlet Veteran $3.50.\nMaster: Corrupted Gauntlet Master $12.00. Corrupted Gauntlet Speed-Chaser $7.00. Defence Doesn't Matter II $8.00. Defence Doesn't Matter $3.50. Gauntlet Master $15.00. Gauntlet Speed-Chaser $8.00.\nGrandmaster: Corrupted Gauntlet Grandmaster $65.00. Corrupted Gauntlet Speed-Runner $17.00. Egniol Diet II $5.50. Gauntlet Speed-Runner $16.00.\nNota: el bundle de la página dice «Gauntlet 16 tareas $80», 3 más que las 13 que devuelve el buscador por «Gauntlet».",
    "b_0208": "<strong>Gauntlet Pricing</strong> (asume max salvo indicación contraria; posibles aumentos según combat stats y prayers desbloqueadas; bulk discount en un solo pedido de 200+ kc — importe del descuento no indicado; los pedidos bulk deben completarse en su totalidad y no pueden cancelarse una vez empezados): Regular Gauntlet 1m | w/ Rigour/Augury ($0.30); Corrupted Gauntlet 3.5m | w/ Rigour/Augury ($1.05).\n<strong>Gauntlet &amp; CG CAs</strong> («All combat diary achievement pricing assumes max stats and both cox prayers»): Regular Gauntlet: Gauntlet Speed-Runner (Sub 4:00) 50M ($15.00); Perfect Crystalline Hunllef 10M ($3.00); Defence Doesn't Matter 10M ($3.00); 3,2,1 - Range 5M ($1.50); Egniol Diet 10M ($3.00); Crystalline Warrior 10M ($3.00); Wolf Puncher 6M ($1.80). Corrupted Gauntlet: Egniol Diet II 25M ($7.50); Wolf Puncher II 20M ($6.00); CG Speed-Runner (sub 6:30) 60M ($18.00); Perfect Corrupted Hunllef 20M ($6.00); Defence Doesn't Matter II 15M ($4.50); Corrupted Warrior 25M ($7.50); 3,2,1 - Mage 8M ($2.40).",
