    "b_0307": "<strong>Mini Quests (22; total publicado «prices for all the quests is : 155M», pero la suma de los 22 ítems es 189,7M — discrepancia, §D.1):</strong> Alfred Barcrawl 4M; Architectural Alliance 4.5M; Bear Your Soul 7M; Curse of the Empty Lord 15M; The Enchanted Key 15M; Enter the Abyss 4M; Family Pest 5M; The General's Shadow 10M; Hopespear's Will 8M; Lair of Tarn 4M; Skippy and the Morges 4M; Morges Hat Hunt 3M; Morges Flippers Hunt 4M; Search of Knowledge 1.2M; Daddy's Home 3M; The Frozen Door 25M; His Faithful Servants 2M; In Search of Knowledge 20M; Into the Tombs 15M; Lair of Tarn Razorlor 6M; Mage Arena 1 10M; Mage Arena 2 20M.\nNota: «Search of Knowledge - 1.2M» (Mini Quests) frente a «In search of knowledge - 20M» (P2P) — nombres casi idénticos, precios distintos, tal como se publican. Mage Arena 1/2 coinciden en Mini Quests y en la sección de Capes (10M y 20M).",
