    "b_0312": "<strong>Miniquest / Special, sin dificultad (19):</strong> Alfred Grimhand's Barcrawl $1.43. Barbarian Training $12.00. Bear your soul $2.24. Curse of the Empty Lord $3.47. Daddy's Home $2.04. Enter the Abyss $1.43. Family Pest $1.43. His Faithful Servants $2.04. Hopespear's Will $2.24. In Search of Knowledge $5.92. Into the Tombs $1.63. Lair of Tarn Razorlor $1.63. Mage Arena I $3.06. Mage Arena II $5.92 (+$1.00 por cada desbloqueo de hechizo). Skippy and the Mogres $1.22. The Enchanted Key $2.65. The Frozen Door $12.00. The General's Shadow $2.24. Vale Totems $1.20.",
    "b_0313": "<strong>Miniquests (21):</strong> Alfred Grimhand'S Barcrawl $1.00. Architectural Alliance $0.80. Bear Your Soul SIN PRECIO. Curse Of The Empty Lord $1.50. Daddy'S Home SIN PRECIO. Enchanted Key $2.20. Enter The Abyss SIN PRECIO. Family Pest $0.80. Frozen Door $5.00. The General'S Shadow SIN PRECIO. His Faithful Servants SIN PRECIO. Hopespear'S Will $2.00. King'S Ransom Minigame $1.80. In Search Of Knowledge $2.50. Into The Tombs $2.00. Lair Of Tarn Razorlor SIN PRECIO. Mage Arena 1 $1.80. Mage Arena 2 $5.00. Skippy And The Mogres $1.20. Vale Totems $1.20. Barbarian Training $1.20.\nSin precio en miniquests (6): Bear Your Soul, Daddy'S Home, Enter The Abyss, The General'S Shadow, His Faithful Servants, Lair Of Tarn Razorlor.",
