    "b_0426": "<strong>Slayer Boss KC</strong> (página general; los precios de esta página <strong>difieren</strong> de los de las páginas de CA de cada jefe — véase §D): <strong>Abyssal Sire:</strong> 1m ($0.30) — max gear: emberlight/scythe + scorching bow/shadow for vents. <strong>Alchemical Hydra:</strong> 1m — Twisted Bow (Dragon Arrows) ($0.30); 1.1m — Twisted Bow (Amethyst/Rune Arrows) ($0.33); 1.2m — Blowpipe (Amethyst/Rune Darts) ($0.36); 1.25m — Bofa + Armour ($0.38); 1.3m — Blowpipe (Adamant Darts) ($0.39). <strong>Araxxor:</strong> 750k — Scythe ($0.23); 950k — Bludgeon ($0.29); 1.25m — Zombie Axe ($0.38). <strong>Cerberus:</strong> 500k — Scythe ($0.15); 600k — Emberlight or Tbow ($0.18). *No spectral automatic +25k/kill ($0.0075). <strong>Grotesque Guardians:</strong> 650k — Scythe/Bp D darts/ven bow ($0.20); 1.0m — whip/Bp rune darts ($0.30). <strong>Kraken:</strong> 200k — Ibans or higher ($0.06). <strong>Thermonuclear Smoke Devil:</strong> 300k — max gear ($0.09). <strong>pcharges for ir</strong>s without max pool (chally poh method).\n<strong>Slayer Boss CAs** (desplegab</strong>, 7 páginas): <strong>Abyssal Sire CAs — KC Tasks:** 600k ($0.1</strong> — assuming max gear: DWH, Arclight or Scythe, Trident/bofa for vents; 1m/kc ($0.30) — with whip - sub optimal gear. CAs: Abyssal Adept (20kc) — KC Task; Don't Whip Me — Included w/ Perfect Sire; Don't Stop Moving — Included w/ Perfect Sire; They Grow Up Too Fast 20m ($6.00); Respiratory Runner 10m ($3.00); Perfect Sire 10m ($3.00); Demonic Rebound 5m ($1.50); Abyssal Veteran (50kc) — KC Task. <strong>Alchemical </strong>dra CAs — KC Tasks (per/kc):<strong> 450k — Twisted Bow (Dra</strong>n Arrows) ($0.14); 525K — (Other Arrows) ($0.16); 600k — Blowpipe (Amethyst/Rune Darts) ($0.18); 750k — Blowpipe (Adamant Darts) ($0.23); 700k — FBow + Armour ($0.21). CAs: Alchemical Veteran (75kc) — KC Task; Working Overtime 15m ($4.50); Lightning Lure — Included w/ Alcleanical Hydra [sic]; Alcleanical Hydra [sic] 5m ($1.50); The Flame Skipper 5m ($1.50); Unrequired Antipoisons — Included w/ Alcleanical Hydra; Alchemical Speed-Chaser 5m ($1.50); Mixing Correctly 5m ($1.50); Don't Flame Me 5m ($1.50); Alchemical Master (150) — KC Task; Alchemical Speed-Runner 30m ($9.00); No Pressure 20m ($6.00). <strong>Araxxor CAs** (KC tasks: «See Slaye</strong>Boss KC tab below»): Speed-Trialist 10m ($3.00); Relaxed Gamer 5m ($1.50); Araxyte Betrayal 5m ($1.50); Perfect Araxxor 20m ($6.00); Let it seep in 10m ($3.00); Arachnid Lover 20m ($6.00); Speed-Chaser 15m ($4.50); Speed-Runner 20m ($6.00); Perfect Araxxor 2 30m ($9.00); Swimming in Venom 15m ($4.50). <strong>Cerberus CAs — KC Task</strong><strong> 250k — Scythe ($0.08); 250k — Tbow ($0.0</strong>; 300k — Arclight ($0.09); 500k — Suboptimal gear ($0.15). *No spectral automatic +50k/kill ($0.02). *Upcharges apply if not max gear. *Prices are per/kc. CAs: Unrequired Antifire 5m ($1.50); Anti-Bite Mechanics 5m ($1.50); Ghost Buster 5m ($1.50); Cerberus Veteran (75kc) — KC Task; Arooo No More 5m ($1.50); Cerberus Master (150kc) — KC Task. <strong>Grotesque Guardians CAs — KC Tasks:</strong> 350k — Scythe/Bp D darts ($0.11); 500k — whip/bp rune darts ($0.15). *Prices are per/kc. CAs: Grotesque Guardians Adept (25kc) — KC Task; Static Awareness — Included w/ Perfect GG's; Prison Break — Included w/ Perfect GG's; Heal No More — Included w/ Perfect GG's; Don't Look at the Eclipse — Included w/ Perfect GG's; Granite Footwork — Included w/ Perfect GG's; Grotesque Guardians Veteran (50kc) — KC Task; Perfect Grotesque Guardians 10m ($3.00); Done before Dusk 5m ($1.50); From Dusk... 5m ($1.50); Grotesque Guardians Speed-Trialist — Included w/ Speed Runner; Perfect Grotesque Guardians II 25m ($7.50); ... 'til Dawn 20m ($6.00); Grotesque Guardians Speed-Chaser — Included w/ Speed Runner; Grotesque Guardians Speed-Runner 15m ($4.50). <strong>Kraken CAs — KC Tasks:</strong> 175k — ibans or higher ($0.05). *Prices per/kc. CAs: Kraken Adept (20kc) — KC Task; Krakan't Hurt Me — incl w/ One Hundred Tentacles; Unnecessary Optimization 5m ($1.50); Ten-tacles — Incl w/ One Hundred Tentacles; One Hundred Tentacles 25m ($7.50). <strong>Thermonuclear Smoke Devil CAs — KC Tasks:</strong> 250k — max gear ($0.08). *Upcharges for irons without max pool (chally poh method). *Prices per/kc. CAs: Thermonuclear Veteran (20kc) — KC Task; Spec'd Out 10m ($3.00); Hazard Prevention 5m ($1.50).",
    "b_0427": "<strong>Slayer Bosses:</strong> Alchemical Hydra — Twisted Bow with Rigour 600k/kc, without Rigour 660k/kc; Bowfa + Armour with Rigour 850k/kc, without Rigour 940k/kc; Blowpipe with Rigour (rune dart at least) 950k/kc, without Rigour 1.2m/kc. Abyssal Sire — With required gear 600k/kc, Missing requirements +100k per missing requirement per kill. Cerberus — Arclight 500k/kc, Bowfa 600k/kc. Grotesque Guardians — Max gear 550k/kc, Normal gear 620k/kc. Thermonuclear Smoke Devil — Scythe/Blowpipe 320k/kc, Tent Whip/Blowpipe 450k/kc. Kraken — Ibans/Toxic Trident 250k/kc. Araxxor — «Max gear upcharge if low; • 800k kc Bludgeon +» [texto truncado en la fuente, sin detalle completo].",
