    "b_0631": "Capes &amp; Endgame:\n- Guaranteed Enhance + Infernal Cape: from $549.00, SAVE UP TO $200.00. Opciones: 80+ stats, no CoX or Titan prayers $849.00. 80+, Titan prayers $749.00. 80+, CoX prayers $699.00. 85+, no CoX or Titan $799.00. 85+, Titan $699.00. 85+, CoX $649.00. 90+, no Titan or CoX $699.00. 90+, Titan $599.00. 90+, CoX $549.00. Add-ons: Guarantee full Crystal Armour +$49.00. Add Dizana's Quiver +$59.00 (requiere 80+ Magic y 80+ Ranged).\n- Max Cape From Scratch: $3,999.00 (antes $7,499.00, SAVE $3,500.00; el cliente aporta 1B GP en supplies). Add the Quest Cape +$249.00 (ahorra $100.00).\n- The Full Schebang: from $249.00, SAVE UP TO $140.00 — With megarares $249.00. No megarares $349.00 (Quiver + Infernal Cape + Blood Torva + Radiant Oathplate).\n- Blorva + Radiant Bundle: from $159.00, SAVE UP TO $70.00 — Max gear $159.00. Non-max gear $229.00.\n- Wilderness Completed: $799.00 (antes $899.00, SAVE $100.00) — farmear los bosses de Wilderness hasta las 3 piezas de Voidwaker.\nRaids &amp; Logs:\n- Megarare Trio: $8,499.00 (antes $10,499.00, SAVE $2,000.00) — Twisted Bow + Tumeken's Shadow + Scythe of Vitur; asume Bowfa, Ayak y Blade o Tent.\n- One Purple From Each Raid: $289.00 (antes $349.00, SAVE $60.00).\n- Green Log Chambers of Xeric: $6,499.00, SAVE $2,000.00+ (no incluye KC cape).\n- Green Log Theatre of Blood: $5,299.00, SAVE $2,500.00+ (Scythe incluida; no incluye KC cape).\n- Every ToB Weapon: $4,899.00, SAVE $600.00+ (Scythe + Sanguinesti Staff + Ghrazi Rapier).\nIronman:\n- Ironman Early Game Bundle: $299.00 (antes $539.00, SAVE $240.00) — Medium CA, Full Void, All Medium Diaries.\n- Early Iron Plug &amp; Play: $749.00 (antes $839.00, SAVE $90.00) — Barrows Gloves + Song of the Elves; Black Mask reqs + guaranteed Black Mask +$59.00 (ahorra $100.00 frente a por separado).\n- Med Iron Ready: $394.00 (antes $494.00, SAVE $100.00) — Full Moons of Peril collection log, 2 Guaranteed Tormented Synapses, 1 Guaranteed Zulrah unique; Both Royal Titans prayer scrolls (Mystic Vigour + Deadeye, normalmente $100.00) +$79.00.\n- Ironman Weapon &amp; Armour Bundle: $229.00 (antes $304.00, SAVE $75.00) — Guaranteed Zombie Axe, tank armour de Barrows, 1 full set de Moons of Peril; requiere 80+ combat.\n- Entry Into the End Game: $357.00 (antes $434.00, SAVE $77.00) — Guaranteed Noxious Halberd (normalmente $179, en bundle $149), Guaranteed Dragon Warhammer (normalmente $120, en bundle $99), Guaranteed Dragon Hunter Wand (normalmente $135, en bundle $109); Guaranteed Ranger Boots (Medium clues hasta que caigan; normalmente $650.00, ahorra $150.00) +$499.00.\n- Zenyte Jewellery Bundle: $149.00 — las 4 Zenytes de Demonic Gorillas; Booster finds the slayer task / off task añade 20% +$30.00.\n- Express Mystic Chinning for Irons: $259.00 (10.000 chinchompas cazadas + 9 sesiones).\n- Ironman Secondary Bundle: $64.00 — 25 herb runs + 25 birdhouse runs, 1.000 ultracompost, 2.000 teleport tabs, 2.000 snape grass + 2.000 red spider eggs.\nSlayer &amp; Prep:\n- Slayer Points Bundle: from $129.00, SAVE UP TO $51.00 — 5.000 slayer points $129.00. 10.000 slayer points $249.00 (ambos asumen 100+ combat).\n- Blood Shards x5: $99.00 (antes $125.00, SAVE $26.00; requiere 99 Thieving y acceso a Darkmeyer / Sins of the Father).\n- Bingo Prep Bundle: $399.00 (antes $480.00, SAVE $81.00) — 5.000 slayer points, 2.000 GOTR pulls, 1.000 Wintertodt pulls, 1.000 Tempoross pulls.\nCompletionist &amp; Logs:\n- Champion Scroll Bundle: $399.00 — los 11 champion scrolls + todos los campeones.\n- MTA Green Log: $130.00 (antes $156.00, SAVE $26.00).\n- Tithe Farm Green Log: $35.00 (antes $40.00, SAVE $5.00).",
