    "b_0663": "Deep Delve (Wave 8+): $1.70 cada uno; 50+ runs: 30% off.",
    "b_0664": "Delve / Doom of Mokhaiotl (incl. Delve CAs y bundle $155), Radiant Oathplate (incl. Recolour Bundle y adquisiciones), Blood Torva, COX Megascales (100% Purple, protecciones de scroll, Mystic Chinning), Account Builds (paquetes Iron y Main, SOTE, Quest Cape, Thralls, Spec XFer Alt), Ironman Gathering (implings, birdhouse, sandmining, cannonballs, herbiboar, karambwans, sharks, anglerfish, ecu keys, dragon bones, chinchompas, planks, glass, ores, agility pyramid, fungus, berries, scales, sceptre, wines, spider eggs, snape grass, sunfire splinters), Yama CA Bundle y Yama kills (bot), Sailing (skill nueva, bot), Guaranteed Drops y Raids 4 / The Fractured Archive (solo web), compra de cuentas pre-entrenadas (solo web), Fire Cape y Corrupted Gauntlet (solo web), Bald+ / Prime.",
    "b_0665": "Delve / Doom: Discord «Delve CA Bundle $155» vs web «Delve (8 tareas) $100». Discord «Play Through $20» vs web Deep Delve $1.70 cada uno (Wave 8+), Level 1–8 $4.25 cada uno (unidades distintas: por run vs por piso).",
    "b_0666": "Delve CA Bundle - All Delve CAs $155. Yama CA Bundle: minus KC + Contract $95; minus KC + No Contract $55. Zuk CA Bundles: Jad Skip + Speed $105. Speed+Nibblers+Jad Skip+Budget $225. Speed+Nibblers+Jad Skip $165. All tasks inc KC $315. Quiver CA Bundles: Bulk KC = $35 / 215m (así publicado, unidad ambigua). Brought mine too + Slow dancing + Speed = $65. Speed CA free with any max gear Quiver. TOA Bundle: ALL PERFECTIONS $45. ALL TOA EXPERT Exc Speed $305. Inc Speed $355. Gauntlet Bundle - ALL CAs MINUS KC $80. DT2 Bundle - ALL CAs MINUS KC $185 (save $25). Godwars - ALL GWD CAs ex KC $205. COX Bundles: Full Leech $18.50 (49 CA points). Participation $25 (65 CA points). All Speeds (Participation) $105. All Speeds (Login) $125. TOB Bundle: Minimal participation $14 (31 CA points). Participation $18 (48 CA points). All Speeds Participation $120. Login $135. All HMT Speeds: Participation $100. Login $110. «Prices assume max gear. Parsec +30%».",
    "b_0667": "Desert Treasure 2 (from $15.00, ~4 h): No Brews +$2.00 (+5 min), No Xeric's talisman +$2.00 (+5 min), Below 94 Mage +$2.00 (+5 min), No Staminas +20% (+10% de tiempo), Parsec +40%; Dragon Slayer 2 (from $10.00, ~3 h): No Brews +$3.00 (+5 min), Below 80 Range +$4.00 (+10 min), No Goutweed +$1.00 (+10 min), Ancient Cavern access +$2.00 (+20 min), No Staminas +20% (+10% de tiempo), Parsec +40%; Desert Treasure 1 (from $6.00, ~1.5 h): Below 43 Prayer +$10.00 (+60 min), No Staminas +20%, Parsec +40%; The Blood Moon Rises (from $30.00, ~3 h): Below 85 Combat +$5.00 (+5 min), No Staminas +20% (+10% de tiempo), Parsec +40%; Dream Mentor: No goutweed +$1.00 (+10 min); Secrets of the North: Below 100 Combat +$3.00 (+5 min), No Icy basalt +$2.00 (+10 min); RFD - Freeing King Awowogei (from $1.80, ~1 h): No Gorilla/Ninja/Zombie monkey greegree +$2.00 (+20 min), No Staminas +20%, Parsec +40%; Mudfoot's Big Adventure y The Writing's on the Wall: No Staminas +20%, Parsec +40%. En el sitio, muchas misiones muestran «1–4 options» sin detallar el importe en la lista (el importe aparece al añadir/seleccionar); solo se verificaron en detalle las anteriores.",
    "b_0668": "Desglose ampliado:\n- Barbarian Assault: Full fighter torso (normal) $22.50 (leech $11.25). Torso (leech) $25.00 (promedio de pedidos, tu tarea puede variar). 200 attack XP $6.80. 200 strength XP $6.80. 200 defence XP $6.80. 200 range XP $6.80. 200 magic XP $6.80. 200 prayer XP $6.80. Granite body $7.00. BA level 5 (All Roles) $95.00. Attack $40. Attack (leech) $20. Strength $40. Strength (leech) $25. Defence $40. Defence (leech) $25. Range $40. Range (leech) $25. Mage $40. Mage (leech) $25. Healer $60. Healer (leech) $50 (el contador de la página dice 18 opciones; se listan 22 líneas).\n- Clues (por clue): Beginner $1.20. Easy $0.24. Medium $0.17. Hard $0.19. Elite $0.40. Says $0.34. Master $0.54. Armadyl $5. Bandos $5 (la página dice 10 opciones; se listan 9 líneas de precio).\n- Mage Training Arena: MTA Green Log $130.00. Full infinity set $65. Infinity top $21.30. Juggling $9.18 (sin unidad clara en la página). Mage's book $27.50. Alchemy $9.18. Telekinetic $9.18. Graveyard $9.18. Enchantment $9.18. Bonus $15 (la página dice 9 opciones).\n- Mastering Mixology: 1 to 100 $548.53. 1 to 90 $252.90. 1 to 70 $69.55. 1 to 55 $26.85. 1 to 35 $2.20. Single order (3 runs) $3.50. Alchemy $9.18.\n- Last Man Standing: 25 kills $18.00. 100 kills $72.00. 500 kills $282.00. 1,000 kills $360.00. 2,000 kills $600.00. 5,000 kills $1,500.00 (racha de 100+ kills).\n- Giants Foundry (por encargo): Ali legs $15. Ali sword $15. Ali shield $15. Ali helmet $15. Ali armour $15. Ali gloves $15 (cada uno «$15 EACH»?) — en la página cada pieza aparece con $0.25 y total $0.25; el precio base «from $0.25» corresponde al encargo básico y las piezas Alien se listan a $15 cada una.\n- Tithe Farm: 1 to 80 $72.00. 1 to 100 $106.90. 1 to 54 $13.03. 1 to 74 $46.10. 1 to 34 $2.89.",
    "b_0669": "Desglose ampliado:\n- Farming runs (por run): Herb run – 6 Patches $0.80. Allotment run $1.20. Herb + Allotment $1.80. Seaweed run $0.41. Herb run – 10 patches $1.20. Herb Run – 8 Patches $1.00.\n- Mining: Sandmining w/ humidify / circlet $1.00 per 1k. Sandmining w/o humidify / circlet $1.10 per 1k. Amethyst Ore w/ Expert Gloves $15.00 per 1k. Amethyst Ore w/o Expert Gloves $30.00 per 1k. Bone Shards – Calcium Rocks $1.30 per 1k.\n- Red chinchompas (por 1.000): 63+ Hunter $9.00. 75+ Hunter $8.00. 83+ Hunter $7.00.\n- Pharaoh's sceptre: 51–60 Thieving $28.00. 61–70 $25.50. 71–80 $24.00. 81–90 $19.55. 91+ $18.00.\nNota de la página: muchos suministros son más baratos con el diary o el nivel adecuados.",
